(2017099, 278586, 41521, '<td valign="top">I was looking at a portfolio today that had a lot of pepper shots in it.  I''m making a bet with myself as to who this image belongs to. :)  I love sweet orange bells, and this image is a standout.  Nice use of light, reflection, mist on the subject.</td>', 'I was looking at a portfolio today that had a lot of pepper shots in it.  I''m making a bet with myself as to who this image belongs to. :)  I love sweet orange bells, and this image is a standout.  Nice use of light, reflection, mist on the subject.', '2006-01-09 01:14:18.000000', NULL, 1);
