(2017104, 278173, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very cute. Nice example of the challenge!</td>', 'Very cute. Nice example of the challenge!', '2006-01-09 01:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017105, 278541, 34013, '<td valign="top">great shot!!  vivid colors, looks like a jeep ad!</td>', 'great shot!!  vivid colors, looks like a jeep ad!', '2006-01-09 01:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017108, 277610, 34763, '<td valign="top">Great contrast and sharpness, cool!</td>', 'Great contrast and sharpness, cool!', '2006-01-09 01:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017110, 278457, 41521, '<td valign="top">Should have peeled the sticker, or turned the orange over.  It detracts from the image, imo.  Top lemon is kind of dirty, too.  Nice selection of fruits, good lighting.  Back apple seems a bit out of focus, my eye keeps getting drawn over there to find the problem.</td>', 'Should have peeled the sticker, or turned the orange over.  It detracts from the image, imo.  Top lemon is kind of dirty, too.  Nice selection of fruits, good lighting.  Back apple seems a bit out of focus, my eye keeps getting drawn over there to find the problem.', '2006-01-09 01:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017111, 276801, 34763, '<td valign="top">very well done</td>', 'very well done', '2006-01-09 01:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017112, 278556, 41521, '<td valign="top">Wood ducks are sooo nice to look at, and photograph.  Nice reflection.</td>', 'Wood ducks are sooo nice to look at, and photograph.  Nice reflection.', '2006-01-09 01:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017116, 278525, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - those are some eyes. What if you did a selective color adjustment and removed some of the black from the kitty''s coat (white)?  Or maybe a slight adjustment of contrast would work too. The focus is tack sharp and I like how the whiskers show up with the ribbons of color as their backdrop.</td>', 'WOW - those are some eyes. What if you did a selective color adjustment and removed some of the black from the kitty''s coat (white)?  Or maybe a slight adjustment of contrast would work too. The focus is tack sharp and I like how the whiskers show up with the ribbons of color as their backdrop.', '2006-01-09 01:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017118, 278128, 34013, '<td valign="top">nice contrast with the pepper and bg. also bg pattern is awesome</td>', 'nice contrast with the pepper and bg. also bg pattern is awesome', '2006-01-09 01:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017120, 277887, 34013, '<td valign="top">reminds me of ben and jerrys! love it! something new and different!!</td>', 'reminds me of ben and jerrys! love it! something new and different!!', '2006-01-09 01:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017122, 278559, 34013, '<td valign="top">lol! too clever!</td>', 'lol! too clever!', '2006-01-09 01:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017123, 278073, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the urban edginess of this.  I''d even like it if the graffiti weren''t there. The touch of green of her sweater poking through the sleeve is a nice touch.</td>', 'I like the urban edginess of this.  I''d even like it if the graffiti weren''t there. The touch of green of her sweater poking through the sleeve is a nice touch.', '2006-01-09 01:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017125, 278092, 34013, '<td valign="top">great shot!!</td>', 'great shot!!', '2006-01-09 01:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017126, 277782, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think the burst sense would have been better had the background not been so similar to the hat.  Cute picture nonetheless.</td>', 'I think the burst sense would have been better had the background not been so similar to the hat.  Cute picture nonetheless.', '2006-01-09 01:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017129, 278444, 34013, '<td valign="top">great shot. fun hair! :)</td>', 'great shot. fun hair! :)', '2006-01-09 01:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017136, 278348, 15711, '<td valign="top">I usually don''t go for target centered subjects, but this works, with the trees leaning into it like lacy fingers.  I love the sky!!!</td>', 'I usually don''t go for target centered subjects, but this works, with the trees leaning into it like lacy fingers.  I love the sky!!!', '2006-01-09 01:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017137, 278493, 34013, '<td valign="top">nice saturation, nice composition.</td>', 'nice saturation, nice composition.', '2006-01-09 01:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017138, 277636, 34763, '<td valign="top">Indeed the best thought out flower arangement, the way you have blurred the leaves makes the flowers burst out like a 3-D movie, well done.</td>', 'Indeed the best thought out flower arangement, the way you have blurred the leaves makes the flowers burst out like a 3-D movie, well done.', '2006-01-09 01:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017139, 278193, 42826, '<td valign="top">oh don''t do it!!!!</td>', 'oh don''t do it!!!!', '2006-01-09 01:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
