(2017162, 276371, 34013, '<td valign="top">her expression is cute. cool makeup too. fits challenge perfectly!</td>', 'her expression is cute. cool makeup too. fits challenge perfectly!', '2006-01-09 01:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017167, 276956, 34013, '<td valign="top">great lighting</td>', 'great lighting', '2006-01-09 01:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017184, 277887, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is f-ing hilarious.  You took the literal direction of the challenge and ran with it. HURRAH for you!! This has a definite POW factor and Andy Warhol would have loved it!!  Bravo for your orginality.<br/> <br/>Oh and by the way, we had a 48 purple DeSoto that my mother inherited from an aunt and guess what we called it????</td>', 'This is f-ing hilarious.  You took the literal direction of the challenge and ran with it. HURRAH for you!! This has a definite POW factor and Andy Warhol would have loved it!!  Bravo for your orginality. Oh and by the way, we had a 48 purple DeSoto that my mother inherited from an aunt and guess what we called it????', '2006-01-09 01:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017200, 278444, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective and the clarity. The tilt suits the image too. All of the lines, both in the brick and the up and down of the bars is great duplicity, BUT to me, color was supposed to offset the subject.  Maybe all of her colors are offsetting her from the rather drabness of the wall and metal columns but I took it to mean that maybe just one bright patch of color. I think if it were just her mittens, or just her hair that were more the focal colors, it might suit me more, although if I were just to see this NOT in a challenge, I''d rave on and on. OH, I just did. .  .  .  .  I''m still staring at it and it''s growing on me. I think I see your point and the title kind of explains your intent.  Ok, now that I''ve written a novelette... I''ll vote. 8</td>', 'I love the perspective and the clarity. The tilt suits the image too. All of the lines, both in the brick and the up and down of the bars is great duplicity, BUT to me, color was supposed to offset the subject.  Maybe all of her colors are offsetting her from the rather drabness of the wall and metal columns but I took it to mean that maybe just one bright patch of color. I think if it were just her mittens, or just her hair that were more the focal colors, it might suit me more, although if I were just to see this NOT in a challenge, I''d rave on and on. OH, I just did. .  .  .  .  I''m still staring at it and it''s growing on me. I think I see your point and the title kind of explains your intent.  Ok, now that I''ve written a novelette... I''ll vote. 8', '2006-01-09 01:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017213, 277275, 15711, '<td valign="top">To me, this suits the challenge perfectly. That one spot of POW amidst the drabness of tones in the rest of the shot. To be honest, I wish the green and white Starbucks sign weren''t there, it distracts a bit for me. 8</td>', 'To me, this suits the challenge perfectly. That one spot of POW amidst the drabness of tones in the rest of the shot. To be honest, I wish the green and white Starbucks sign weren''t there, it distracts a bit for me. 8', '2006-01-09 01:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017221, 277978, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think the border ruins the impact of the turquoise pump for me. I''d like it with a simple black one, or maybe none at all.</td>', 'I think the border ruins the impact of the turquoise pump for me. I''d like it with a simple black one, or maybe none at all.', '2006-01-09 01:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017222, 277038, 50948, '<td valign="top">Original, beautiful, creative...a masterpiece!</td>', 'Original, beautiful, creative...a masterpiece!', '2006-01-09 01:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017230, 277077, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL - I''m bumping up a point for the awesome title. ha ha ha This is a great reflective image.  ha ha ha ha- I can''t stop laughing at your clever name.</td>', 'ROFL - I''m bumping up a point for the awesome title. ha ha ha This is a great reflective image.  ha ha ha ha- I can''t stop laughing at your clever name.', '2006-01-09 01:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017236, 277955, 15711, '<td valign="top">I wish the yellow house were in focus - as it is, it is like an afterthought. I''d like to see it in focus, and the foreground more blurred.  But I still like the image - I might even saturate the yellow a tad more. Maybe as it is, use the lasso, and then do unsharp mask just on the house to sharpen it up a bit. 7</td>', 'I wish the yellow house were in focus - as it is, it is like an afterthought. I''d like to see it in focus, and the foreground more blurred.  But I still like the image - I might even saturate the yellow a tad more. Maybe as it is, use the lasso, and then do unsharp mask just on the house to sharpen it up a bit. 7', '2006-01-09 01:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017245, 278039, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and it has the POP factor. It seems a tad out of focus and then maybe repaired with unsharp mask. Or maybe I need to go to sleep and look again in the morning!!  Very vivid - love the purple tones!</td>', 'Very pretty and it has the POP factor. It seems a tad out of focus and then maybe repaired with unsharp mask. Or maybe I need to go to sleep and look again in the morning!!  Very vivid - love the purple tones!', '2006-01-09 01:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017247, 278078, 17613, '<td valign="top">Nice image</td>', 'Nice image', '2006-01-09 01:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017249, 278598, 45000, '<td valign="top">Noice.....................................................................................................................................................................................................................................................................blue is my favorite color.  Nice eye, love the freakin detail.  It''s almost as if when you look into the eye, you are looking into another universe....another place...another time.</td>', 'Noice.....................................................................................................................................................................................................................................................................blue is my favorite color.  Nice eye, love the freakin detail.  It''s almost as if when you look into the eye, you are looking into another universe....another place...another time.', '2006-01-09 01:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017251, 278201, 17613, '<td valign="top">Sorry doesn''t look natural to me</td>', 'Sorry doesn''t look natural to me', '2006-01-09 01:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017254, 277070, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this alot.  Is that a teddy bear tied to the yellow light??? It suits the challenge IMO and I like the dark dim street with the punch of yellow to grab your attention.</td>', 'I like this alot.  Is that a teddy bear tied to the yellow light??? It suits the challenge IMO and I like the dark dim street with the punch of yellow to grab your attention.', '2006-01-09 01:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017256, 275902, 43434, '<td valign="top">Love it ... nice shot .. I like the fact that it is not overedited.</td>', 'Love it ... nice shot .. I like the fact that it is not overedited.', '2006-01-09 01:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017266, 276024, 31818, '<td valign="top">I predict a ribbon for this one!!!  WOW</td>', 'I predict a ribbon for this one!!!  WOW', '2006-01-09 01:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017267, 278306, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like how you found just an ordinary thing and made it POP.  This is good. Bumping up to an 8 after looking at it again. I realy like it.</td>', 'Nice.  I like how you found just an ordinary thing and made it POP.  This is good. Bumping up to an 8 after looking at it again. I realy like it.', '2006-01-09 01:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017269, 277610, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has delicious tonality. I wonder if it has the draganizer filter. Hmmm - well the perspective and panoramic view is great!</td>', 'This has delicious tonality. I wonder if it has the draganizer filter. Hmmm - well the perspective and panoramic view is great!', '2006-01-09 01:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017273, 278373, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is totally bizarre! The title is priceless in its deadpan approach. It gives me a "WTF?" moment. The whole concept here is so off-the-wall I can''t stop grinning. Technically, I''m not thrilled, the composition seems off, the whole thing''s a tad flat, but you by GAWD have an actual "burst" of color here :-) Good score from me.</td>', 'This is totally bizarre! The title is priceless in its deadpan approach. It gives me a "WTF?" moment. The whole concept here is so off-the-wall I can''t stop grinning. Technically, I''m not thrilled, the composition seems off, the whole thing''s a tad flat, but you by GAWD have an actual "burst" of color here :-) Good score from me.', '2006-01-09 02:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017274, 278598, 31818, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, I love the pattern.</td>', 'Very nice shot, I love the pattern.', '2006-01-09 02:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017275, 277777, 31818, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I think a top ten</td>', 'Very nice, I think a top ten', '2006-01-09 02:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017277, 277772, 31818, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture, Top ten for sure</td>', 'Excellent capture, Top ten for sure', '2006-01-09 02:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017278, 278527, 30861, '<td valign="top">Nice title. I had come into this challenge expecting to feel negative about shots that used a color surround to emphasize a colorless subject, but this shot has sown me it is a perfectly valid approach if used well. Which it certainly is here...</td>', 'Nice title. I had come into this challenge expecting to feel negative about shots that used a color surround to emphasize a colorless subject, but this shot has sown me it is a perfectly valid approach if used well. Which it certainly is here...', '2006-01-09 02:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017280, 278559, 31818, '<td valign="top">Great thought process.  I predict a top 15</td>', 'Great thought process.  I predict a top 15', '2006-01-09 02:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017281, 277430, 31818, '<td valign="top">Simple, but nice</td>', 'Simple, but nice', '2006-01-09 02:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017284, 278041, 31818, '<td valign="top">Scored high but will take it back if you don''t explain</td>', 'Scored high but will take it back if you don''t explain', '2006-01-09 02:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017285, 276801, 31818, '<td valign="top">Nice shot</td>', 'Nice shot', '2006-01-09 02:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017310, 276908, 30861, '<td valign="top">"Use a colorful impact to offset your subject from the rest of the photograph." This is a lovely image of a rose, but the entire frame has been filled with "subject", there is nothing the red is being offset from or by. For that reason this really doesn''t answer the challenge, no matter how fine it may otherwise be. A 5 from me, for it is surely colorful so you got half of it :-)</td>', '"Use a colorful impact to offset your subject from the rest of the photograph." This is a lovely image of a rose, but the entire frame has been filled with "subject", there is nothing the red is being offset from or by. For that reason this really doesn''t answer the challenge, no matter how fine it may otherwise be. A 5 from me, for it is surely colorful so you got half of it :-)', '2006-01-09 02:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017319, 277174, 30861, '<td valign="top">"Use a colorful impact to offset your subject from the rest of the photograph." There''s not really any "rest of the photograph" here, IMO.</td>', '"Use a colorful impact to offset your subject from the rest of the photograph." There''s not really any "rest of the photograph" here, IMO.', '2006-01-09 02:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017320, 278428, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice!</td>', 'nice!', '2006-01-09 02:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017325, 278525, 48876, '<td valign="top">Absolutely Beautiful!Best cat photo I have EVER seen!!!</td>', 'Absolutely Beautiful!Best cat photo I have EVER seen!!!', '2006-01-09 02:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017330, 278103, 30861, '<td valign="top">This would be SO much better if it were rotated ccw to square the vertical lines; there are SO many of them it''s very disturbing. Great capture.</td>', 'This would be SO much better if it were rotated ccw to square the vertical lines; there are SO many of them it''s very disturbing. Great capture.', '2006-01-09 02:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017335, 277448, 30861, '<td valign="top">Great title! Competent and amusing image, lacks a little wow factor for me, but nice anyway :-) On looking at it further I''m amused by the downvast expression of the small fish and the somewhat leering look of the large fish''s eye.</td>', 'Great title! Competent and amusing image, lacks a little wow factor for me, but nice anyway :-) On looking at it further I''m amused by the downvast expression of the small fish and the somewhat leering look of the large fish''s eye.', '2006-01-09 02:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017340, 278422, 48876, '<td valign="top">I''m really glad you decided to enter this anyway!I think it is beautiful and fits the challenge!</td>', 'I''m really glad you decided to enter this anyway!I think it is beautiful and fits the challenge!', '2006-01-09 02:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017343, 278237, 22479, '<td valign="top">Great colors in this abstract. Great exposure and lighting.</td>', 'Great colors in this abstract. Great exposure and lighting.', '2006-01-09 02:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017344, 278527, 48876, '<td valign="top">Wow!It really draws you in. Fantastic color choice!</td>', 'Wow!It really draws you in. Fantastic color choice!', '2006-01-09 02:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017348, 278586, 22479, '<td valign="top">Peppers never looked so good, haha! I like the lighting and the sharp details.</td>', 'Peppers never looked so good, haha! I like the lighting and the sharp details.', '2006-01-09 02:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017354, 277708, 30861, '<td valign="top">"Use a colorful impact to offset your subject from the rest of the photograph." In this case, the entire framer is the subject and nothing is being offset, by color or any other means. Nice shot, though :-)</td>', '"Use a colorful impact to offset your subject from the rest of the photograph." In this case, the entire framer is the subject and nothing is being offset, by color or any other means. Nice shot, though :-)', '2006-01-09 02:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017357, 277610, 40341, '<td valign="top">absolutly awesome!!! great composition</td>', 'absolutly awesome!!! great composition', '2006-01-09 02:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017364, 277772, 40341, '<td valign="top">great idea &amp; photo</td>', 'great idea & photo', '2006-01-09 02:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017368, 277188, 22479, '<td valign="top">A charming entry for this challenge. I like the nice, clean, and unobtrusive processing.</td>', 'A charming entry for this challenge. I like the nice, clean, and unobtrusive processing.', '2006-01-09 02:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017371, 278580, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty, no question about it, but has it crossed the line from photography to graphic arts?</td>', 'This is very pretty, no question about it, but has it crossed the line from photography to graphic arts?', '2006-01-09 02:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017372, 278284, 35545, '<td valign="top">Need to check your spelling.</td>', 'Need to check your spelling.', '2006-01-09 02:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017373, 278328, 35545, '<td valign="top">Don''t care much for your title.</td>', 'Don''t care much for your title.', '2006-01-09 02:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017375, 278341, 35545, '<td valign="top">Finally.  Someone who understands what this challenge is about.  Great colors.  Great use of depth of field.</td>', 'Finally.  Someone who understands what this challenge is about.  Great colors.  Great use of depth of field.', '2006-01-09 02:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017377, 275651, 35545, '<td valign="top">For me, this would have worked better if you had just concentrated on taking pictures of the colored houses.  The white houses don''t stand out, because you hve white sand as part of the "background".  (Foreground, really.)</td>', 'For me, this would have worked better if you had just concentrated on taking pictures of the colored houses.  The white houses don''t stand out, because you hve white sand as part of the "background".  (Foreground, really.)', '2006-01-09 02:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017379, 278559, 35545, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, but I would like to have seen a greater depth of field.  It fuzzes out in the background and in the foreground.</td>', 'Cute idea, but I would like to have seen a greater depth of field.  It fuzzes out in the background and in the foreground.', '2006-01-09 02:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017382, 278525, 35545, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but the to my eye, the cat''s face really doesn''t stand out from the background.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but the to my eye, the cat''s face really doesn''t stand out from the background.', '2006-01-09 02:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017383, 277893, 35545, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors, but I''d like to see a fuzzier background.  There is enough definition here that the background distracts from the flowers.</td>', 'I really like the colors, but I''d like to see a fuzzier background.  There is enough definition here that the background distracts from the flowers.', '2006-01-09 02:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017385, 278152, 35545, '<td valign="top">I''d have cropped this to get rid of the water tower and the sky.  They overwhelm the little boy, and there''s enough blue in the sky that you lose the impact of his bright blue jacket.</td>', 'I''d have cropped this to get rid of the water tower and the sky.  They overwhelm the little boy, and there''s enough blue in the sky that you lose the impact of his bright blue jacket.', '2006-01-09 02:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017387, 275902, 35545, '<td valign="top">The colored background is so busy that, to my eye, the little boy really doesn''t stand out.</td>', 'The colored background is so busy that, to my eye, the little boy really doesn''t stand out.', '2006-01-09 02:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017388, 277331, 35545, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the use of desat here.  The leaves look like someone spray painted them.</td>', 'Don''t like the use of desat here.  The leaves look like someone spray painted them.', '2006-01-09 02:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017400, 278148, 10261, '<td valign="top">The color on the lettering seems a little washed out. Since that seems to be the intended subject I think that the composition is weakened by this fact. I think that a more minimalistic setting might have served you better here. The light source and whatever the perforated plastic thing is don''t seem to add anything to the composition. Illuminating the disk''s label against a black background with the light reflected off of the back of another CD would have had a much stronger impact.</td>', 'The color on the lettering seems a little washed out. Since that seems to be the intended subject I think that the composition is weakened by this fact. I think that a more minimalistic setting might have served you better here. The light source and whatever the perforated plastic thing is don''t seem to add anything to the composition. Illuminating the disk''s label against a black background with the light reflected off of the back of another CD would have had a much stronger impact.', '2006-01-09 03:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017401, 277610, 22479, '<td valign="top">Very lush. This reminds me of an e301 landscape (it''s a good thing). Subtle colors but very detailed even at such small dimensions. 10</td>', 'Very lush. This reminds me of an e301 landscape (it''s a good thing). Subtle colors but very detailed even at such small dimensions. 10', '2006-01-09 03:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017403, 277263, 22479, '<td valign="top">A very artistic entry. Love it. 10</td>', 'A very artistic entry. Love it. 10', '2006-01-09 03:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017404, 277275, 22479, '<td valign="top">Such a wonderful composition. I think you nailed the exposure. A great entry for this challenge. Revisiting...bumping up.</td>', 'Such a wonderful composition. I think you nailed the exposure. A great entry for this challenge. Revisiting...bumping up.', '2006-01-09 03:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017405, 276709, 22479, '<td valign="top">Truly a burst of colors in this pristine shot. Bumping up.</td>', 'Truly a burst of colors in this pristine shot. Bumping up.', '2006-01-09 03:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017406, 276024, 22479, '<td valign="top">Love the reflection and relative muteness of the surrounding elements in the photo. Bumping up.</td>', 'Love the reflection and relative muteness of the surrounding elements in the photo. Bumping up.', '2006-01-09 03:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017407, 278470, 10261, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the harsh lighting. The sharp shadows only seem to distract from the rest of the composition. I like the fact that the painter is included in the picture (it makes it feel like something other than a photograph of a picture), but I think that including _all_ of her is overkill. The muted colors of the model''s clothing work well, but I''d be interested in seeing how altering her saturation in either direction would have changed the mood of the image.</td>', 'I don''t care for the harsh lighting. The sharp shadows only seem to distract from the rest of the composition. I like the fact that the painter is included in the picture (it makes it feel like something other than a photograph of a picture), but I think that including _all_ of her is overkill. The muted colors of the model''s clothing work well, but I''d be interested in seeing how altering her saturation in either direction would have changed the mood of the image.', '2006-01-09 03:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017409, 276801, 22479, '<td valign="top">Fascinating high key shot of the iris.</td>', 'Fascinating high key shot of the iris.', '2006-01-09 03:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017411, 278541, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like the sky, but the rocks feel overdone. Part of what makes the work of Joey, heida and the other Photoshop masters around here so impressive is that they know when to stop. The tree that snuck into the right side of the image is a bit distracting. Cloning or cropping it out would have improved the composition.</td>', 'I like the sky, but the rocks feel overdone. Part of what makes the work of Joey, heida and the other Photoshop masters around here so impressive is that they know when to stop. The tree that snuck into the right side of the image is a bit distracting. Cloning or cropping it out would have improved the composition.', '2006-01-09 03:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017412, 278193, 10261, '<td valign="top">The woman''s hand is almost more vibrantly colored than the balloon, and none of the colors are particularly saturated. The position of the woman''s fingers seems a little odd; making her pose look a little more intentional would improve the image, as would catching the balloon mid-pop.</td>', 'The woman''s hand is almost more vibrantly colored than the balloon, and none of the colors are particularly saturated. The position of the woman''s fingers seems a little odd; making her pose look a little more intentional would improve the image, as would catching the balloon mid-pop.', '2006-01-09 03:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
