(2017829, 278581, 38234, '<td valign="top">cool abstract and nice entry</td>', 'cool abstract and nice entry', '2006-01-09 09:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017831, 275656, 38234, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the minimalism plus it''s a beautiful butterfly, but to me the subject should be a bit larger and the whites are very blown:-(</td>', 'I like the idea and the minimalism plus it''s a beautiful butterfly, but to me the subject should be a bit larger and the whites are very blown:-(', '2006-01-09 09:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017832, 278597, 38234, '<td valign="top">beautiful entry - one of my favourites so far!!</td>', 'beautiful entry - one of my favourites so far!!', '2006-01-09 09:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017833, 278330, 38234, '<td valign="top">great food shot, nicely arranged and very colourful - would make a great entry for the recipe challenge too:-)</td>', 'great food shot, nicely arranged and very colourful - would make a great entry for the recipe challenge too:-)', '2006-01-09 09:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017852, 276709, 7628, '<td valign="top">Your use of depth of focus really makes this stand out.  Also the yellow and the blue make eachother pop.  Very pleasant to look at as well as colorful!</td>', 'Your use of depth of focus really makes this stand out.  Also the yellow and the blue make eachother pop.  Very pleasant to look at as well as colorful!', '2006-01-09 09:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017855, 277070, 44611, '<td valign="top">Brilliant.  A real burst of colour in an otherwise bleak scene.  Well captured.</td>', 'Brilliant.  A real burst of colour in an otherwise bleak scene.  Well captured.', '2006-01-09 09:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017856, 276343, 7628, '<td valign="top">This looks like it took a lot of work to set up - well done!  An innovative idea, well worked out.  I like how the frames are not square with the edges of the picture - it adds to the bursting effect.</td>', 'This looks like it took a lot of work to set up - well done!  An innovative idea, well worked out.  I like how the frames are not square with the edges of the picture - it adds to the bursting effect.', '2006-01-09 09:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017857, 277430, 44611, '<td valign="top">Neat - as a row of pins!</td>', 'Neat - as a row of pins!', '2006-01-09 09:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017862, 278041, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very unusual idea - I am curious to know how you acheived these waves of color.  The composition is a bit loose - the chin being cropped and that slightly distracting black triangle in the bottom right corner and something hazy in the bottom left.  Imaginative and colorful nonetheless.</td>', 'Very unusual idea - I am curious to know how you acheived these waves of color.  The composition is a bit loose - the chin being cropped and that slightly distracting black triangle in the bottom right corner and something hazy in the bottom left.  Imaginative and colorful nonetheless.', '2006-01-09 09:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017865, 277893, 44611, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and contrasts.  This is very special.</td>', 'Lovely colours and contrasts.  This is very special.', '2006-01-09 09:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017870, 277837, 7628, '<td valign="top">Fun!  I like the emotional burst that mirrors (not pun intended!) the color burst.  Wish the right hand side of the photo were either cropped more or less - I find the white triangle of space a the top right distracting and the necklace at the bottom too - but it is minor compared to the clean effective image.</td>', 'Fun!  I like the emotional burst that mirrors (not pun intended!) the color burst.  Wish the right hand side of the photo were either cropped more or less - I find the white triangle of space a the top right distracting and the necklace at the bottom too - but it is minor compared to the clean effective image.', '2006-01-09 09:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017873, 276371, 7628, '<td valign="top">Wonderful make-up job, and lovely refelctions in your eyes.  I like how the line of wood in the background intersects the line on the eyes - and all right about on the thirds line - a nice composition.  I wish you had not cropped the top of your head so much - crop the bottom a bit more and include more of the top of the frame would work better IMO.  But this is another great shot - well prepared, well lit, well thought out.</td>', 'Wonderful make-up job, and lovely refelctions in your eyes.  I like how the line of wood in the background intersects the line on the eyes - and all right about on the thirds line - a nice composition.  I wish you had not cropped the top of your head so much - crop the bottom a bit more and include more of the top of the frame would work better IMO.  But this is another great shot - well prepared, well lit, well thought out.', '2006-01-09 09:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017877, 278541, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic composition - the burst of the clouds, the red rock creating a line along the thirds line.  The saturation is a bit too much for me - but the challenge does call for it after all.  Very nice.</td>', 'Very dramatic composition - the burst of the clouds, the red rock creating a line along the thirds line.  The saturation is a bit too much for me - but the challenge does call for it after all.  Very nice.', '2006-01-09 09:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017879, 278597, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and composition!  :)</td>', 'Beautiful color and composition!  :)', '2006-01-09 09:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017884, 278080, 18349, '<td valign="top">Wow...this is very pretty.  The petal edges look oversharpened and the burning of the sky is a tad excessive, but lovely nonetheless.  :)</td>', 'Wow...this is very pretty.  The petal edges look oversharpened and the burning of the sky is a tad excessive, but lovely nonetheless.  :)', '2006-01-09 09:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017886, 275289, 18349, '<td valign="top">If this were not quite so bright in the whites and a little more detail was visible in the contents of the pots, this would be a ribboner.  Gorgeous color and composition.  :)</td>', 'If this were not quite so bright in the whites and a little more detail was visible in the contents of the pots, this would be a ribboner.  Gorgeous color and composition.  :)', '2006-01-09 09:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017887, 278580, 19672, '<td valign="top">???<br/> <br/>Looks more like digital art....weird</td>', '??? Looks more like digital art....weird', '2006-01-09 09:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017888, 277636, 35545, '<td valign="top">This is just me, but I would have gotten rid of the white vase.  The blob of white detracts from the dramatic impact of the flowers and green on the black background.  Really reat shot.</td>', 'This is just me, but I would have gotten rid of the white vase.  The blob of white detracts from the dramatic impact of the flowers and green on the black background.  Really reat shot.', '2006-01-09 09:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017889, 278525, 7628, '<td valign="top">A sweet shot - well done!  This is a very agreeable cat - mine would never let me get such a shot - must have been tricky for you.  I like the collar framing the face - works perfectly with the white fur to draw our eyes to the lovely green of the cats eyes - good use of color!  There is an odd bit of gray in the top left corner - a shadow or the cat''s tail - it is a bit distracting.  Forgot to say how I like the pink ears and nose!</td>', 'A sweet shot - well done!  This is a very agreeable cat - mine would never let me get such a shot - must have been tricky for you.  I like the collar framing the face - works perfectly with the white fur to draw our eyes to the lovely green of the cats eyes - good use of color!  There is an odd bit of gray in the top left corner - a shadow or the cat''s tail - it is a bit distracting.  Forgot to say how I like the pink ears and nose!', '2006-01-09 09:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017890, 276879, 18349, '<td valign="top">What a cutie...Peanut would be most proud!  :)</td>', 'What a cutie...Peanut would be most proud!  :)', '2006-01-09 09:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017891, 277275, 19672, '<td valign="top">Too bad all the newspaper racks and poles make it the photo too noisy. Otherwise nice composition and good focus, and a nice light tone.</td>', 'Too bad all the newspaper racks and poles make it the photo too noisy. Otherwise nice composition and good focus, and a nice light tone.', '2006-01-09 09:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017892, 276085, 18349, '<td valign="top">Wow...elegant and sexy at the same time.  Nice dress and pose; would prefer a less centered composition but lovely all the same.  :)</td>', 'Wow...elegant and sexy at the same time.  Nice dress and pose; would prefer a less centered composition but lovely all the same.  :)', '2006-01-09 09:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017894, 278416, 19672, '<td valign="top">We seem to have started a trend with all these magnetix shots.</td>', 'We seem to have started a trend with all these magnetix shots.', '2006-01-09 09:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017895, 278193, 19672, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...</td>', 'Nice shot...', '2006-01-09 09:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017896, 278325, 19672, '<td valign="top">Not quite the most bursty of entries but a very nice photo none-the-less</td>', 'Not quite the most bursty of entries but a very nice photo none-the-less', '2006-01-09 09:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017897, 277038, 18349, '<td valign="top">I hope this is legal because I would hate to see such a cute image DQd.  Adorable idea; great color.  Innovative.  :)</td>', 'I hope this is legal because I would hate to see such a cute image DQd.  Adorable idea; great color.  Innovative.  :)', '2006-01-09 09:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017898, 278546, 35545, '<td valign="top">It looks to me as if you have just taken a picture of an ad.  Where is your input in the composition?</td>', 'It looks to me as if you have just taken a picture of an ad.  Where is your input in the composition?', '2006-01-09 09:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017901, 277610, 19672, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture, should be a calendar</td>', 'Beautiful capture, should be a calendar', '2006-01-09 09:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017903, 276379, 35545, '<td valign="top">What is the subject here?  I can''t see that anything stands out.</td>', 'What is the subject here?  I can''t see that anything stands out.', '2006-01-09 09:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017904, 277188, 18349, '<td valign="top">I love this...I hope it does well.  Great color, composition, and clarity.  Needs maybe some dodging on the eyes and the cheek/hair on this side, but no biggie.  :)</td>', 'I love this...I hope it does well.  Great color, composition, and clarity.  Needs maybe some dodging on the eyes and the cheek/hair on this side, but no biggie.  :)', '2006-01-09 09:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017906, 278525, 18349, '<td valign="top">Awwww what a gorgeous kitty!  Lovely collar as well.  Would like to see it just a tad brighter in the greys.  Nice image.  :)</td>', 'Awwww what a gorgeous kitty!  Lovely collar as well.  Would like to see it just a tad brighter in the greys.  Nice image.  :)', '2006-01-09 09:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017908, 278324, 35545, '<td valign="top">I guess the CD-ROM is the subject, but it''s so similar in tone and color to the background that it really doesn''t pop out.</td>', 'I guess the CD-ROM is the subject, but it''s so similar in tone and color to the background that it really doesn''t pop out.', '2006-01-09 09:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017910, 277610, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, and a top ten in any other challenge for sure...I hope the literal-minded voters don''t vote you down for the colors being rather subtle and subdued.  Gorgeous!  :)</td>', 'Very pretty, and a top ten in any other challenge for sure...I hope the literal-minded voters don''t vote you down for the colors being rather subtle and subdued.  Gorgeous!  :)', '2006-01-09 09:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017913, 278371, 19672, '<td valign="top">Should have been backlighting...would have done much better there</td>', 'Should have been backlighting...would have done much better there', '2006-01-09 09:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017914, 277708, 18349, '<td valign="top">This would be awesome without the scale in the foreground.  Great composition otherwise.  :)</td>', 'This would be awesome without the scale in the foreground.  Great composition otherwise.  :)', '2006-01-09 09:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017917, 278532, 35545, '<td valign="top">There''s just too much going on in this picture -- the green background, the reflections, the colorful globes, the lily pads...   I think you might have done better to go for one of the globes with a great reflection, or one of the globes with a shallow depth of field.</td>', 'There''s just too much going on in this picture -- the green background, the reflections, the colorful globes, the lily pads...   I think you might have done better to go for one of the globes with a great reflection, or one of the globes with a shallow depth of field.', '2006-01-09 09:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017918, 278559, 11854, '<td valign="top">ROFLMAO! 10</td>', 'ROFLMAO! 10', '2006-01-09 09:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017920, 278162, 35545, '<td valign="top">This is a very colorful picture, but I can''t say that any one object jumps out at me due to the color.</td>', 'This is a very colorful picture, but I can''t say that any one object jumps out at me due to the color.', '2006-01-09 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017924, 277610, 35545, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic landscape, but I can''t say that any one object jumps out at me because of a burst of color.  It''s all very subdued.</td>', 'Very dramatic landscape, but I can''t say that any one object jumps out at me because of a burst of color.  It''s all very subdued.', '2006-01-09 09:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017925, 278284, 18207, '<td valign="top">I love this one, even if "yet another selective desat". Grats!</td>', 'I love this one, even if "yet another selective desat". Grats!', '2006-01-09 09:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2017927, 277003, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2006-01-09 09:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
