(2017945, 278599, 18207, '<td valign="top">For me, it''s a bit soft and under-exposed even for an evening shot. But I like the mood pretty much and it fits the theme.</td>', 'For me, it''s a bit soft and under-exposed even for an evening shot. But I like the mood pretty much and it fits the theme.', '2006-01-09 10:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
