(2018524, 277893, 42984, '<td valign="top">Terrific depth of field and perfect capture of natures selective de-saturation :)  Centering your subjects doesn''t always give the best visual effect, it would be even better with the blooms on thirds</td>', 'Terrific depth of field and perfect capture of natures selective de-saturation :)  Centering your subjects doesn''t always give the best visual effect, it would be even better with the blooms on thirds', '2006-01-09 13:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
