(2018601, 278583, 42984, '<td valign="top">Technically brilliant.  You''ve held the papers texture while still giving it a gradient - I''m impressed.  The composition is so sophisticated, it takes my breath away.  This could hang as a 6ftx4ft mural in any corporate boardroom!</td>', 'Technically brilliant.  You''ve held the papers texture while still giving it a gradient - I''m impressed.  The composition is so sophisticated, it takes my breath away.  This could hang as a 6ftx4ft mural in any corporate boardroom!', '2006-01-09 14:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
