(2018606, 277159, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great photograph, very arty and moody.  The bright colors of the building almost compete rather than offset.  Almost but not quite, subject is offset.<br/>Well done!</td>', 'Great photograph, very arty and moody.  The bright colors of the building almost compete rather than offset.  Almost but not quite, subject is offset.Well done!', '2006-01-09 14:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2018615, 278153, 42984, '<td valign="top">Very cute and clever.  One of those images that makes you smile which is really good stuff. If it suffers anywhere it is because you''ve had to crop the birds so close to the left hand edge which has messed up your best composition options.  From this angle, I can see that if you''d added any more left margin, you''d have ended up with the house next door as a horrid distraction.  The solution I think would have been to take 5 steps to the left which would have made the ivy as the background to the birds, the foreground tree would have nestled between the door and window and you would have had more cropping options.  Easy to be wise after the fact huh :)</td>', 'Very cute and clever.  One of those images that makes you smile which is really good stuff. If it suffers anywhere it is because you''ve had to crop the birds so close to the left hand edge which has messed up your best composition options.  From this angle, I can see that if you''d added any more left margin, you''d have ended up with the house next door as a horrid distraction.  The solution I think would have been to take 5 steps to the left which would have made the ivy as the background to the birds, the foreground tree would have nestled between the door and window and you would have had more cropping options.  Easy to be wise after the fact huh :)', '2006-01-09 14:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
