(2019016, 278553, 42984, '<td valign="top">Very simple, very good.  The lighting balance is great, you''ve got all the detail of the leaf, held its colour and maintained a presense in the blue background.  The eye travels bottom-lef to top-right so the angle of the leaf is right on that leading line.  The composition may have cost you a point overall.  Get the leaf onto a thirds line, or even better, a thrids intersection and you''d have a point back I believe.</td>', 'Very simple, very good.  The lighting balance is great, you''ve got all the detail of the leaf, held its colour and maintained a presense in the blue background.  The eye travels bottom-lef to top-right so the angle of the leaf is right on that leading line.  The composition may have cost you a point overall.  Get the leaf onto a thirds line, or even better, a thrids intersection and you''d have a point back I believe.', '2006-01-09 16:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
