(2019206, 278369, 1717, '<td valign="top">wow...that actually looks like a lot of fun.  i love jigsaw puzzles.  very nice photo and a clever idea for the challenge.</td>', 'wow...that actually looks like a lot of fun.  i love jigsaw puzzles.  very nice photo and a clever idea for the challenge.', '2006-01-09 17:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019207, 276879, 47704, '<td valign="top">I should give a low score just for torturing a dog!!!!!   LOL</td>', 'I should give a low score just for torturing a dog!!!!!   LOL', '2006-01-09 17:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019212, 278234, 1717, '<td valign="top">not sure what i''m looking at but i like it! :)</td>', 'not sure what i''m looking at but i like it! :)', '2006-01-09 17:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019214, 277049, 47704, '<td valign="top">This could have been good but the lighting is very bad and the DOF is confusing to the eye.  2</td>', 'This could have been good but the lighting is very bad and the DOF is confusing to the eye.  2', '2006-01-09 17:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019220, 278580, 1717, '<td valign="top">hmmm...a bit too abstract for my tastes, i''m afraid.  it no longer resembles a photograph.  it looks like it would be a nice scene if the post-processing wasn''t as heavy handed.</td>', 'hmmm...a bit too abstract for my tastes, i''m afraid.  it no longer resembles a photograph.  it looks like it would be a nice scene if the post-processing wasn''t as heavy handed.', '2006-01-09 17:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019222, 278527, 47704, '<td valign="top">Amazing.  I would say the only thing that could have been better would have been brighter eyes but it is still great.  10</td>', 'Amazing.  I would say the only thing that could have been better would have been brighter eyes but it is still great.  10', '2006-01-09 17:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019229, 277636, 33352, '<td valign="top">Good execution of color, shows color bursting from deep to outer....10</td>', 'Good execution of color, shows color bursting from deep to outer....10', '2006-01-09 17:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019233, 278039, 47704, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what happened here.  Looks like it was processed to the end of its life in PS.  If not, there''s a ton of noise and nto much in focus.  The focal point is spread throughout the pic so the rule of thirds is kind of messed up.  This gets a 2 and not a 1 because it''s not as bad as the Oops challenge pic of the foot stepping in dog crap.</td>', 'I''m not sure what happened here.  Looks like it was processed to the end of its life in PS.  If not, there''s a ton of noise and nto much in focus.  The focal point is spread throughout the pic so the rule of thirds is kind of messed up.  This gets a 2 and not a 1 because it''s not as bad as the Oops challenge pic of the foot stepping in dog crap.', '2006-01-09 17:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019234, 277638, 1717, '<td valign="top">not sure what i''m looking at.  the dark spots in the white border are terribly distracting from the subject...um...whatever it is.</td>', 'not sure what i''m looking at.  the dark spots in the white border are terribly distracting from the subject...um...whatever it is.', '2006-01-09 17:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019242, 277921, 43901, '<td valign="top">I like the meters but the fence is really distracting - try another angle?</td>', 'I like the meters but the fence is really distracting - try another angle?', '2006-01-09 17:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019244, 277481, 47704, '<td valign="top">Interesting pic but I think I speak for a lot of people in saying XMAS IS OVER.</td>', 'Interesting pic but I think I speak for a lot of people in saying XMAS IS OVER.', '2006-01-09 17:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019245, 278433, 43901, '<td valign="top">Very colorful, nice</td>', 'Very colorful, nice', '2006-01-09 17:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019250, 278564, 43901, '<td valign="top">Great photo but just doesn''t "burst" with color</td>', 'Great photo but just doesn''t "burst" with color', '2006-01-09 17:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019281, 276879, 47852, '<td valign="top">Hmm.. I hadn''t thought about offsetting the main subject from the color.  Interesting.  This little guy/gal doesn''t look so happy about the setup though!</td>', 'Hmm.. I hadn''t thought about offsetting the main subject from the color.  Interesting.  This little guy/gal doesn''t look so happy about the setup though!', '2006-01-09 17:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019290, 278335, 1717, '<td valign="top">clever shot :)  i have to give this a nice score just because of the fastback Mustang...next to a ''70 Plymouth Hemi-Cuda, it''s my fav car. :)</td>', 'clever shot :)  i have to give this a nice score just because of the fastback Mustang...next to a ''70 Plymouth Hemi-Cuda, it''s my fav car. :)', '2006-01-09 17:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019292, 277265, 47852, '<td valign="top">This shot looks almost void of color, except for the bit around the bright spot, which seems to be over processed.  Perhaps if you were aiming for impact, leaving a orange-ish hue to the impact light could have worked while still keeping with the color theme.</td>', 'This shot looks almost void of color, except for the bit around the bright spot, which seems to be over processed.  Perhaps if you were aiming for impact, leaving a orange-ish hue to the impact light could have worked while still keeping with the color theme.', '2006-01-09 17:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019297, 277981, 1717, '<td valign="top">hmmm...i saw a photo of a salad earlier and it made me hungry.  now i''m starving!  nice use of the sparks to set the subject apart!</td>', 'hmmm...i saw a photo of a salad earlier and it made me hungry.  now i''m starving!  nice use of the sparks to set the subject apart!', '2006-01-09 17:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019301, 275656, 47852, '<td valign="top">I can tell that you were using a shallow dof here, but the removal of the color makes it all sort of fuzzy and hard to figure out.  The butterfly too seems overprocessed and unnaturally colored.</td>', 'I can tell that you were using a shallow dof here, but the removal of the color makes it all sort of fuzzy and hard to figure out.  The butterfly too seems overprocessed and unnaturally colored.', '2006-01-09 17:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019317, 278559, 47852, '<td valign="top">Clever.  I love the way you made the crayons into little people!  The dof seems just a bit too shallow, since you can clearly see a line of sand that is perfectly focused.  I also might like to have seen this a bit more brightly lit, since the idea is that the orange guy melted in the sun.  Extra points for creativity and setup!</td>', 'Clever.  I love the way you made the crayons into little people!  The dof seems just a bit too shallow, since you can clearly see a line of sand that is perfectly focused.  I also might like to have seen this a bit more brightly lit, since the idea is that the orange guy melted in the sun.  Extra points for creativity and setup!', '2006-01-09 17:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019326, 277072, 47852, '<td valign="top">Flowers seem a bit out of place in the snow, and the whole shot seems dim.</td>', 'Flowers seem a bit out of place in the snow, and the whole shot seems dim.', '2006-01-09 17:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019330, 275289, 41066, '<td valign="top">simply fantastic!  Where are these kinds of shots when I am looking for them?? hehe  I would be interested to find out what that stuff is!  Good Work!</td>', 'simply fantastic!  Where are these kinds of shots when I am looking for them?? hehe  I would be interested to find out what that stuff is!  Good Work!', '2006-01-09 17:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019331, 278489, 47852, '<td valign="top">OUCH!  Those thorns look nasty!  Great eye to find a natural subject for the challenge, and I like the angle.  I might have bumped up the color/contrast a bit to bring the yellow out a bit more.</td>', 'OUCH!  Those thorns look nasty!  Great eye to find a natural subject for the challenge, and I like the angle.  I might have bumped up the color/contrast a bit to bring the yellow out a bit more.', '2006-01-09 17:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019340, 276817, 47852, '<td valign="top">Reflection is distracting on the blue sphere.  Might have tried wearing dark gloves, moving the camera down a bit more to be behind the stone, or even cloning out the reflection of your hand and camera.  A neat collection of stones for this shot.</td>', 'Reflection is distracting on the blue sphere.  Might have tried wearing dark gloves, moving the camera down a bit more to be behind the stone, or even cloning out the reflection of your hand and camera.  A neat collection of stones for this shot.', '2006-01-09 17:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019348, 278080, 1717, '<td valign="top">beautiful!</td>', 'beautiful!', '2006-01-09 17:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019352, 277188, 47852, '<td valign="top">What a cutie!  Love the colorful hat and the blue eyes.. perfect for the challenge.</td>', 'What a cutie!  Love the colorful hat and the blue eyes.. perfect for the challenge.', '2006-01-09 17:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019374, 278060, 1717, '<td valign="top">awwww how sweet :)</td>', 'awwww how sweet :)', '2006-01-09 18:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019375, 277070, 47852, '<td valign="top">Is that a teddy bear hanging up there?  How strange.  I''m having trouble getting past it to see the rest of the shot.  Neat shot though, and I love the bright yellows.</td>', 'Is that a teddy bear hanging up there?  How strange.  I''m having trouble getting past it to see the rest of the shot.  Neat shot though, and I love the bright yellows.', '2006-01-09 18:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
