(2022612, 277870, 30982, '<td valign="top">Colorful, but not especially "interesting" - maybe if the glass ball were a little off to one side, and it was darker on one side than the other...</td>', 'Colorful, but not especially "interesting" - maybe if the glass ball were a little off to one side, and it was darker on one side than the other...', '2006-01-10 16:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
