(2022694, 278128, 49773, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge perfectly, maybe you could jast make the black squares totally black(the front ones have some white grain). Idea and overall appearance are great.<br/>good luck</td>', 'meets the challenge perfectly, maybe you could jast make the black squares totally black(the front ones have some white grain). Idea and overall appearance are great.good luck', '2006-01-10 17:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
