(2022708, 278548, 22046, '<td valign="top">Clever idea. For me this is a bit too dark in the right corner. I think a bit of dodging to bring out the shape of the right most bucket would improve this. Still it is a better than average photograph and I give it a 7.</td>', 'Clever idea. For me this is a bit too dark in the right corner. I think a bit of dodging to bring out the shape of the right most bucket would improve this. Still it is a better than average photograph and I give it a 7.', '2006-01-10 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
