(2026637, 276755, 50982, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I like the originality and especially that you thought of it (one would think) and put it together nicely. It''s nice that photographers can compose a picture in their head and capture it still instead of seeing something someone else has done and claim it as their own.<br/>OK, I''m rambling. Great job!</td>', 'Nicely done. I like the originality and especially that you thought of it (one would think) and put it together nicely. It''s nice that photographers can compose a picture in their head and capture it still instead of seeing something someone else has done and claim it as their own.OK, I''m rambling. Great job!', '2006-01-11 13:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
