(2028162, 278566, 19982, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the colors... (i.e. the yellow building against the blue sky).  And I''m not real fond of over saturation.  But in this case, I think you needed to at least boost the saturation - a lot on the yellow and some on the red.  It would have helped make this more of a "burst of color".</td>', 'I like the contrast of the colors... (i.e. the yellow building against the blue sky).  And I''m not real fond of over saturation.  But in this case, I think you needed to at least boost the saturation - a lot on the yellow and some on the red.  It would have helped make this more of a "burst of color".', '2006-01-11 21:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
