(2028758, 277592, 45343, '<td valign="top">I like the color and composition... the diagnal lines give the picture alot of energy.   They don''t, however, lead the eye anywere except out of the frame.  Since it is advanced editing... I would also recomend cloning out the power line.  Never the less... a good image and good use of shutter speed.</td>', 'I like the color and composition... the diagnal lines give the picture alot of energy.   They don''t, however, lead the eye anywere except out of the frame.  Since it is advanced editing... I would also recomend cloning out the power line.  Never the less... a good image and good use of shutter speed.', '2006-01-12 00:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028764, 278564, 45343, '<td valign="top">Nice selective desat and nice background.   Would have been fun if the name on the shirt were red, too.  I like away from camera look your boy has, but it leaves me wondering where he is about to go.   I guess out to play since that is an indoor chair.</td>', 'Nice selective desat and nice background.   Would have been fun if the name on the shirt were red, too.  I like away from camera look your boy has, but it leaves me wondering where he is about to go.   I guess out to play since that is an indoor chair.', '2006-01-12 00:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028771, 278408, 45343, '<td valign="top">colorful and good use of negitave space. Only thing I might change is to back up the background a bit and off set the flash a bit to keep the shadows from perfectly mimicing your subject.  Hope that isn''t someones hair.</td>', 'colorful and good use of negitave space. Only thing I might change is to back up the background a bit and off set the flash a bit to keep the shadows from perfectly mimicing your subject.  Hope that isn''t someones hair.', '2006-01-12 00:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028779, 278558, 45343, '<td valign="top">Nice and colorful... I think I would have better liked a larger depth of focus.  I like your composition.</td>', 'Nice and colorful... I think I would have better liked a larger depth of focus.  I like your composition.', '2006-01-12 00:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028785, 278448, 45343, '<td valign="top">Cute title and concpet.  You''ll need a little "no fish injured" disclaimer.  I wonder if the fish sould have held more energy if it was more off center...  to the right perhaps.</td>', 'Cute title and concpet.  You''ll need a little "no fish injured" disclaimer.  I wonder if the fish sould have held more energy if it was more off center...  to the right perhaps.', '2006-01-12 00:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028798, 278306, 45343, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color and Depth of Field.  Your Horizontal and vertical lines all lead the eye to your subject (excpet one) and your rule of thirds placement aids the subject in holding the attention.  The background yellow triange is a little distracting.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice use of color and Depth of Field.  Your Horizontal and vertical lines all lead the eye to your subject (excpet one) and your rule of thirds placement aids the subject in holding the attention.  The background yellow triange is a little distracting.  Well done.', '2006-01-12 00:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028806, 278489, 45343, '<td valign="top">Ouch!  Nice Depth of Field use.  I like the composition.  The backlighting of the sun casts shadows, muting your color a little.  I wonder if there would have been a better angle or time of day.   Never the less... very nice capture.</td>', 'Ouch!  Nice Depth of Field use.  I like the composition.  The backlighting of the sun casts shadows, muting your color a little.  I wonder if there would have been a better angle or time of day.   Never the less... very nice capture.', '2006-01-12 00:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028813, 278581, 48228, '<td valign="top">Unusual image, but appealing.....</td>', 'Unusual image, but appealing.....', '2006-01-12 00:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2028815, 278541, 45343, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Wonderfully sharp, crisp and focused.  This image is very colorful, but is almost too sturated.   Still, scores well with me.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Wonderfully sharp, crisp and focused.  This image is very colorful, but is almost too sturated.   Still, scores well with me.', '2006-01-12 00:51:47.000000', NULL, 1);
