(2031211, 276343, 5792, '<td valign="top">Well composed, especially wit the white pencil pointed strait into the camera in the center of the frame. Creating way to display a color wheel effect. Subtle use of black in the background to make the colors stand out. The black rectangles are angled enough to be obviously purposeful for artistic effect but some viewers may suggest they should be straight.</td>', 'Well composed, especially wit the white pencil pointed strait into the camera in the center of the frame. Creating way to display a color wheel effect. Subtle use of black in the background to make the colors stand out. The black rectangles are angled enough to be obviously purposeful for artistic effect but some viewers may suggest they should be straight.', '2006-01-12 19:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031222, 277331, 10261, '<td valign="top">This seems to be tilted clockwise slightly. A shallower DoF would have reduced some of the background clutter.</td>', 'This seems to be tilted clockwise slightly. A shallower DoF would have reduced some of the background clutter.', '2006-01-12 19:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031232, 278416, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great color choices... Most people associate primary colors like blue, red and yellow with color bursts. Image quality is generally good but the DOF may be a bit too shallow. A couple silver balls on the bottom and right look slightly out of focus. Taking at a narrower f/stop would fix that. The star is not quite "level" and should be straightened much like a horizon would be straightened.</td>', 'Great color choices... Most people associate primary colors like blue, red and yellow with color bursts. Image quality is generally good but the DOF may be a bit too shallow. A couple silver balls on the bottom and right look slightly out of focus. Taking at a narrower f/stop would fix that. The star is not quite "level" and should be straightened much like a horizon would be straightened.', '2006-01-12 19:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031233, 277900, 5792, '<td valign="top">Cecent colors and floral arrangement. The image appears slightly out of focus but not soft focused.</td>', 'Cecent colors and floral arrangement. The image appears slightly out of focus but not soft focused.', '2006-01-12 19:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031235, 278368, 40019, '<td valign="top">Outstanding picture!  Love the layers created by the mountains. Sun it perfect.  Hope this pic does well - it definitely meets the challenge! Great job!</td>', 'Outstanding picture!  Love the layers created by the mountains. Sun it perfect.  Hope this pic does well - it definitely meets the challenge! Great job!', '2006-01-12 19:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031320, 277830, 47852, '<td valign="top">I like the "inverse" thinking with the b/w bird and colorful background.  Colors in the back look a bit unreal, but the fact that they pop so much works for this shot.  Focus is great... love the feather detail, spots and tree bark.  One of my top picks for this challenge.  Well done!</td>', 'I like the "inverse" thinking with the b/w bird and colorful background.  Colors in the back look a bit unreal, but the fact that they pop so much works for this shot.  Focus is great... love the feather detail, spots and tree bark.  One of my top picks for this challenge.  Well done!', '2006-01-12 20:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031325, 276709, 47852, '<td valign="top">We all get tired of the same flower shots, but this one stands out to me and seems unique.  The use of primary colors, angled flower, shiny vase, and great use of the shallow dof all help to make this shot work really well.  One of my top picks for this challenge.  Well done!</td>', 'We all get tired of the same flower shots, but this one stands out to me and seems unique.  The use of primary colors, angled flower, shiny vase, and great use of the shallow dof all help to make this shot work really well.  One of my top picks for this challenge.  Well done!', '2006-01-12 20:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031332, 278525, 47852, '<td valign="top">Some people complain about the overuse of pet shots, but I love cat shots.  This cat is a perfect subject on the white background, and what a fun and whimsical scarf collar, that just screams "burst of color!"  It looks a tad over saturated with the ears, eyes and nose, but it''s just so cute that it still gets a 10!  One of my favorites from the challenge.  Well done!</td>', 'Some people complain about the overuse of pet shots, but I love cat shots.  This cat is a perfect subject on the white background, and what a fun and whimsical scarf collar, that just screams "burst of color!"  It looks a tad over saturated with the ears, eyes and nose, but it''s just so cute that it still gets a 10!  One of my favorites from the challenge.  Well done!', '2006-01-12 20:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2031334, 277771, 44287, '<td valign="top">This is truly beautiful.</td>', 'This is truly beautiful.', '2006-01-12 20:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
