(2031711, 276371, 20235, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo! Fantastic interpretation and answer to this challenge! The contrasts between her eyes and the earthy color palette create such a nice ''burst'' of color. But do so in a subtle, less literal way than the rest of the entries have. The texture contrasts you''ve captured really add to the shot as well. Love the composition, focus, and subjects facial expression.... I''m voting 9 and adding to faves :)</td>', 'Wonderful photo! Fantastic interpretation and answer to this challenge! The contrasts between her eyes and the earthy color palette create such a nice ''burst'' of color. But do so in a subtle, less literal way than the rest of the entries have. The texture contrasts you''ve captured really add to the shot as well. Love the composition, focus, and subjects facial expression.... I''m voting 9 and adding to faves :)', '2006-01-12 23:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
