(2033402, 277382, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject. Alot of elements on that house to make it interesting to look at. IMHO a more abstract/unconventional POV for the shot would have added to the photo. Taking it from straight eye level adds very little. Given the eclectic nature of your subject, maybe a wide angle perspective, or ground level POV might have emphasized it better? Just my humble opinion, nice shot nonetheless</td>', 'Very interesting subject. Alot of elements on that house to make it interesting to look at. IMHO a more abstract/unconventional POV for the shot would have added to the photo. Taking it from straight eye level adds very little. Given the eclectic nature of your subject, maybe a wide angle perspective, or ground level POV might have emphasized it better? Just my humble opinion, nice shot nonetheless', '2006-01-13 14:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033410, 277918, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice color saturation and layers in this shot</td>', 'Nice color saturation and layers in this shot', '2006-01-13 14:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033416, 277771, 20235, '<td valign="top">I like the direction you''re going with this shot. The subjects and color are isolated so well against the snowy background. Personally, I would have liked to see a tighter shot or more crop to emphasize the subjects more and weight them heavier in the composition with less negative space. Just my humble opinion, nice shot nonetheless</td>', 'I like the direction you''re going with this shot. The subjects and color are isolated so well against the snowy background. Personally, I would have liked to see a tighter shot or more crop to emphasize the subjects more and weight them heavier in the composition with less negative space. Just my humble opinion, nice shot nonetheless', '2006-01-13 14:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2033420, 276125, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and focus on this macro. Great use of DOF to isolate the hand and crayons. Maybe more lighting to remove the shawdows under the hand would have helped?</td>', 'Nice detail and focus on this macro. Great use of DOF to isolate the hand and crayons. Maybe more lighting to remove the shawdows under the hand would have helped?', '2006-01-13 14:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
