(2034484, 278148, 75713, '<td valign="top">great one</td>', 'great one', '2006-01-13 22:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034585, 277761, 20235, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo. The color intense color saturation and tones you''ve captured make this really nice. I like the composition you''ve used also as it creates more dimension to the shot..... 7</td>', 'Lovely photo. The color intense color saturation and tones you''ve captured make this really nice. I like the composition you''ve used also as it creates more dimension to the shot..... 7', '2006-01-13 22:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034589, 278527, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very reminiscent of the famous National Geographic cover shot. I like the detail and focus on this. IMHO more exposure on the eyes may have added to the shot, as the burst of color seems to stem more from the head-dressing rather than the eyes. Yet, the eyes are the main focal point of the shot. Just my humble opinion, nice shot nonetheless... 8</td>', 'Very reminiscent of the famous National Geographic cover shot. I like the detail and focus on this. IMHO more exposure on the eyes may have added to the shot, as the burst of color seems to stem more from the head-dressing rather than the eyes. Yet, the eyes are the main focal point of the shot. Just my humble opinion, nice shot nonetheless... 8', '2006-01-13 22:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034595, 278041, 20235, '<td valign="top">Cool and creative answer to the challenge! I like the mostly dark shot and use of lines and silouhettes.... 8</td>', 'Cool and creative answer to the challenge! I like the mostly dark shot and use of lines and silouhettes.... 8', '2006-01-13 22:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034596, 278113, 20235, '<td valign="top">I love the lines in this photo and how they draw the eye through the shot. Your DOF really created a focal point on the flowers center which works well.... 8</td>', 'I love the lines in this photo and how they draw the eye through the shot. Your DOF really created a focal point on the flowers center which works well.... 8', '2006-01-13 22:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034597, 278444, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I love the creative composition and subject. Her expression contradicts the setting. Very nice.... 8</td>', 'Great shot. I love the creative composition and subject. Her expression contradicts the setting. Very nice.... 8', '2006-01-13 22:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034600, 276642, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the angle you''ve captured this at. The detail, focus, and DOF are great.... 8</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the angle you''ve captured this at. The detail, focus, and DOF are great.... 8', '2006-01-13 22:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034604, 277156, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice answer to this challenge. Love the color and use of selective desat here I really like composition of your subject. Def one of the better entries in this challenge... 9</td>', 'Nice answer to this challenge. Love the color and use of selective desat here I really like composition of your subject. Def one of the better entries in this challenge... 9', '2006-01-13 22:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034747, 278073, 45343, '<td valign="top">A touch of the grunge look, yet with vivid color... unusual and nice combination.  Personally, I wish I could see her face, but I realize that was the look you were after.  Well done.</td>', 'A touch of the grunge look, yet with vivid color... unusual and nice combination.  Personally, I wish I could see her face, but I realize that was the look you were after.  Well done.', '2006-01-13 23:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034754, 278080, 45343, '<td valign="top">The dark vignetting definatly makes your color a splash of color.  Very sharp and crisp... very nice.</td>', 'The dark vignetting definatly makes your color a splash of color.  Very sharp and crisp... very nice.', '2006-01-13 23:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034756, 277049, 45343, '<td valign="top">I love that toy!   Very good subject selection... I am a little distaracted by the pattern in the background (looks like plywood or something).</td>', 'I love that toy!   Very good subject selection... I am a little distaracted by the pattern in the background (looks like plywood or something).', '2006-01-13 23:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034762, 278466, 45343, '<td valign="top">Creative subject choice... Defiantly has color.  The diagonal lines add energy and carry the eye, but to what?  There is no visual reward for the eye at the end of the line...   You just keep going out of the picture.</td>', 'Creative subject choice... Defiantly has color.  The diagonal lines add energy and carry the eye, but to what?  There is no visual reward for the eye at the end of the line...   You just keep going out of the picture.', '2006-01-13 23:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034768, 278152, 45343, '<td valign="top">A nice picture, but seems to be lacking in color for this challenge.  Most of the view is gray.   If it is the blue jacket (most of the color) then I would recommend he take up more of the frame.  If you were trying to contrast the blue sky, it is muted... do you have a circular polarizer?  Highly recommended.</td>', 'A nice picture, but seems to be lacking in color for this challenge.  Most of the view is gray.   If it is the blue jacket (most of the color) then I would recommend he take up more of the frame.  If you were trying to contrast the blue sky, it is muted... do you have a circular polarizer?  Highly recommended.', '2006-01-13 23:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034771, 278275, 45343, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp... I love the texture detail on the skin.  Full of red color.  Only thing I would like different is for the contrasting green leaves to be a little less browned (fresher).   Well done.</td>', 'Nice and sharp... I love the texture detail on the skin.  Full of red color.  Only thing I would like different is for the contrasting green leaves to be a little less browned (fresher).   Well done.', '2006-01-13 23:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034777, 278069, 45343, '<td valign="top">Good subject choice and color.   Are you shinging a red light on the subject, or just really boosted the saturation?   I think the contrast against a pure white background might have worked a little better.</td>', 'Good subject choice and color.   Are you shinging a red light on the subject, or just really boosted the saturation?   I think the contrast against a pure white background might have worked a little better.', '2006-01-13 23:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034779, 277275, 45343, '<td valign="top">Very nice image... I am strugelling with different exposure requiring shots like this.  You have exposed inside and outside perfectly.   I could use some advice.</td>', 'Very nice image... I am strugelling with different exposure requiring shots like this.  You have exposed inside and outside perfectly.   I could use some advice.', '2006-01-13 23:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034787, 278254, 45343, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the color against the pillars.   All the vertical lines makes this picture give a sense of stability.  The composition is a little "50/50" which pulls down the energy provided by the color.  I wonder if a panned back shot with the stand more in the corner would give it more punch.</td>', 'I like the contrast of the color against the pillars.   All the vertical lines makes this picture give a sense of stability.  The composition is a little "50/50" which pulls down the energy provided by the color.  I wonder if a panned back shot with the stand more in the corner would give it more punch.', '2006-01-13 23:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034791, 275656, 45343, '<td valign="top">Very nice selective desat...  I also like the contrast provided by the b/w portion.</td>', 'Very nice selective desat...  I also like the contrast provided by the b/w portion.', '2006-01-13 23:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034795, 276642, 45343, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and color selection.   I think I might have liked a slightly larger DoF, but I''m being picky just to find something for feedback.  It is an excellent image.</td>', 'Nice composition and color selection.   I think I might have liked a slightly larger DoF, but I''m being picky just to find something for feedback.  It is an excellent image.', '2006-01-13 23:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034801, 278074, 45343, '<td valign="top">Hum... a headless camel.  *DQ for cloning out a major element (the head)  I am only kidding, but it does distract a little from the camel''s color... I also think the pyramids beside rather then beneath the camel would have been better.</td>', 'Hum... a headless camel.  *DQ for cloning out a major element (the head)  I am only kidding, but it does distract a little from the camel''s color... I also think the pyramids beside rather then beneath the camel would have been better.', '2006-01-13 23:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034803, 278470, 45343, '<td valign="top">Very nice color target... did you paint it for the challenge.  She seems a little uncomfortable in this pose... at first I thought she was squatting... I think a standing model might have been better.</td>', 'Very nice color target... did you paint it for the challenge.  She seems a little uncomfortable in this pose... at first I thought she was squatting... I think a standing model might have been better.', '2006-01-13 23:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034808, 276413, 45343, '<td valign="top">Yea... I toss caution aside myself.   This is an interesting subject selection and an excellent composition... the leading lines provide by the board walk all lead the eye to your subject.  It does, however, leave you wondering why there is a bucket of caution tape in the street.</td>', 'Yea... I toss caution aside myself.   This is an interesting subject selection and an excellent composition... the leading lines provide by the board walk all lead the eye to your subject.  It does, however, leave you wondering why there is a bucket of caution tape in the street.', '2006-01-13 23:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034814, 276755, 45343, '<td valign="top">These can be difficult shots...  I tried a couple and kept blowing out portions.   It is crisp and well focused.  Well exposed.  I particularly like the filament.</td>', 'These can be difficult shots...  I tried a couple and kept blowing out portions.   It is crisp and well focused.  Well exposed.  I particularly like the filament.', '2006-01-14 00:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034816, 278543, 45343, '<td valign="top">Tasty.  The selection of sour skittles adds an interesting texture to the picture that I like... I wonder, however, if regular skittles would have been more vivid in color.   A very nice image.</td>', 'Tasty.  The selection of sour skittles adds an interesting texture to the picture that I like... I wonder, however, if regular skittles would have been more vivid in color.   A very nice image.', '2006-01-14 00:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034830, 278525, 25270, '<td valign="top">Our cat would have bolted--Nice focus and composition; wonderful color selection</td>', 'Our cat would have bolted--Nice focus and composition; wonderful color selection', '2006-01-14 00:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034831, 277981, 25270, '<td valign="top">Great Submittal for the Recipe contest!</td>', 'Great Submittal for the Recipe contest!', '2006-01-14 00:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034853, 275692, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! I wished that the face and the hand holding the light source aligned. 7</td>', 'Nice shot! I wished that the face and the hand holding the light source aligned. 7', '2006-01-14 00:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034859, 277638, 12160, '<td valign="top">The dots on the white background are a bit distracting and IMO should have been cloned out since cloning is allowed in advanced editing. I like the blue and yellow combination and the patterns of lines and curves. 7</td>', 'The dots on the white background are a bit distracting and IMO should have been cloned out since cloning is allowed in advanced editing. I like the blue and yellow combination and the patterns of lines and curves. 7', '2006-01-14 00:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034867, 278572, 20235, '<td valign="top">Interesting piece of art. I really like the reflections you''ve captured here. The lights themselves look nicely exposed with the shutter speed you used leaving nothing overexposed.</td>', 'Interesting piece of art. I really like the reflections you''ve captured here. The lights themselves look nicely exposed with the shutter speed you used leaving nothing overexposed.', '2006-01-14 00:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034876, 278472, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasts of color here. The creative composition works well. IMHO the shot could have had the same effect with less negative space. Perhaps even if the flag filled most of the frame it would have had the same impact? I wonder if taking this from almost underneath the flag itself with the overcast sky above as a backdrop may have made an interesting shot? Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless</td>', 'Nice contrasts of color here. The creative composition works well. IMHO the shot could have had the same effect with less negative space. Perhaps even if the flag filled most of the frame it would have had the same impact? I wonder if taking this from almost underneath the flag itself with the overcast sky above as a backdrop may have made an interesting shot? Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless', '2006-01-14 00:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034878, 275229, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Your use of selective desaturation answers the challenge well. Perhaps a shallower DOF would have helped to really isolate the center flower?</td>', 'Nice shot. Your use of selective desaturation answers the challenge well. Perhaps a shallower DOF would have helped to really isolate the center flower?', '2006-01-14 00:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034883, 278196, 20235, '<td valign="top">Beautiful macro! Love the colors, detail, and focus here. The high-key approach works well for this challenge. Nice work...... 8</td>', 'Beautiful macro! Love the colors, detail, and focus here. The high-key approach works well for this challenge. Nice work...... 8', '2006-01-14 00:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034885, 278559, 20235, '<td valign="top">Fun and creative shot! I like the composition you''ve used and the DOF here.</td>', 'Fun and creative shot! I like the composition you''ve used and the DOF here.', '2006-01-14 00:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034888, 277651, 12160, '<td valign="top">Love the pattern. Are all these damaged? 6</td>', 'Love the pattern. Are all these damaged? 6', '2006-01-14 00:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034891, 277549, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Great use of DOF to create dimension in this photo. And the creative composition creates a very modern and artistic feel. I could see this hanging in the living room a contemporary home.... 7</td>', 'Nice shot. Great use of DOF to create dimension in this photo. And the creative composition creates a very modern and artistic feel. I could see this hanging in the living room a contemporary home.... 7', '2006-01-14 00:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034894, 278596, 20235, '<td valign="top">Love the candid and fun feel of this photo. The b&amp;w works well to serve the challenge theme. IMHO the lighting seems a tad harsh (I assume flash was used?) and is most apparent in the center subject. Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless</td>', 'Love the candid and fun feel of this photo. The b&w works well to serve the challenge theme. IMHO the lighting seems a tad harsh (I assume flash was used?) and is most apparent in the center subject. Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless', '2006-01-14 00:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034898, 277381, 12160, '<td valign="top">Good shot. I love the sharpness and shape of the green drip. Would have like to see more texture on the lemon. My untrained eye can''t tell whether it was due to shallow DOF or overuse of Neat Image or equivalent. Still good. 7</td>', 'Good shot. I love the sharpness and shape of the green drip. Would have like to see more texture on the lemon. My untrained eye can''t tell whether it was due to shallow DOF or overuse of Neat Image or equivalent. Still good. 7', '2006-01-14 00:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034899, 278147, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot. Love the DOF to isolate the subject and create depth with the web. The flower itself seems a tad overexposed/oversaturated. Maybe exposure tweaks in the RAW stage or layer masks in p-shop would help? Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless</td>', 'Very pretty shot. Love the DOF to isolate the subject and create depth with the web. The flower itself seems a tad overexposed/oversaturated. Maybe exposure tweaks in the RAW stage or layer masks in p-shop would help? Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless', '2006-01-14 00:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034900, 278581, 12160, '<td valign="top">That''s quite an explosion of colors. Good abstract, love the pattern. 9</td>', 'That''s quite an explosion of colors. Good abstract, love the pattern. 9', '2006-01-14 00:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034904, 278470, 20235, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting setup you''ve chosen to work with here. It gives a very raw and untainted feel to the shot. It also works well to create a focal point in the photo. The subject is nicely composed and the color saturation in the painting is good.... 7</td>', 'I like the lighting setup you''ve chosen to work with here. It gives a very raw and untainted feel to the shot. It also works well to create a focal point in the photo. The subject is nicely composed and the color saturation in the painting is good.... 7', '2006-01-14 00:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034909, 278553, 12160, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. The colors complement well. I like the vignetting effect. My top 5 pick. 10</td>', 'Beautiful. The colors complement well. I like the vignetting effect. My top 5 pick. 10', '2006-01-14 00:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034910, 278254, 20235, '<td valign="top">The colors and detail in this shot are fantastic. I like the contrasts in color and temperature here as well as the interplay between light and shadows. Perhaps if the shot was taken from a more unconventional angle (ie. ground level) it may have added more interest to the shot? The concrete rafters look like they could have carried the theme you were going for if shot from down low. Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless</td>', 'The colors and detail in this shot are fantastic. I like the contrasts in color and temperature here as well as the interplay between light and shadows. Perhaps if the shot was taken from a more unconventional angle (ie. ground level) it may have added more interest to the shot? The concrete rafters look like they could have carried the theme you were going for if shot from down low. Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless', '2006-01-14 00:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034915, 276976, 20235, '<td valign="top">Wow, did you really make that from matchsticks? Great colors and contrast with the backdrop you''ve used. Perhaps a tighter shot or more crop to emphasize the subject may have added to the photo? Or even if the subject was shot from below the eyes up, with negative space filling the rest of the composition? Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless</td>', 'Wow, did you really make that from matchsticks? Great colors and contrast with the backdrop you''ve used. Perhaps a tighter shot or more crop to emphasize the subject may have added to the photo? Or even if the subject was shot from below the eyes up, with negative space filling the rest of the composition? Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless', '2006-01-14 00:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034917, 278201, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great landscape shot. The deep dof and detail in this are great. Curious to see the location description and camera settings after the challenge ends..... 7</td>', 'Great landscape shot. The deep dof and detail in this are great. Curious to see the location description and camera settings after the challenge ends..... 7', '2006-01-14 00:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034918, 278134, 20235, '<td valign="top">Good shot under difficult lighting conditions. The composition and DOF is quite nice. IMHO the border is a tad overpowering and seems to ''crowd'' the subject a little. Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless</td>', 'Good shot under difficult lighting conditions. The composition and DOF is quite nice. IMHO the border is a tad overpowering and seems to ''crowd'' the subject a little. Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless', '2006-01-14 00:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034922, 278582, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro. Your focus and detail look spot-on. On my monitor, the photo seems a tad soft and lacks contrast in the pedals. Maybe dialing down the exposure compensation in-camera or post processing may have helped? Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless.... 7</td>', 'Very nice macro. Your focus and detail look spot-on. On my monitor, the photo seems a tad soft and lacks contrast in the pedals. Maybe dialing down the exposure compensation in-camera or post processing may have helped? Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless.... 7', '2006-01-14 00:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034923, 275872, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great colors and lines in this shot. The focus looks nice. Maybe tilting the photo CCW slightly would improve balance?</td>', 'Great colors and lines in this shot. The focus looks nice. Maybe tilting the photo CCW slightly would improve balance?', '2006-01-14 00:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034926, 278041, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Lighting is just enough to illuminate the face which forces the eye to be drawn to the burst of colour above. A ribbon pick for me. 10</td>', 'Nicely done. Lighting is just enough to illuminate the face which forces the eye to be drawn to the burst of colour above. A ribbon pick for me. 10', '2006-01-14 01:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034927, 278199, 20235, '<td valign="top">Wow, colorful bird! I like the composition and DOF you''ve achieved here. IMHO the color palette seems a tad on the cool side? Possibly due to the shade in the background? Maybe adjusting temperature in the RAW stage would have added? Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless.... 7</td>', 'Wow, colorful bird! I like the composition and DOF you''ve achieved here. IMHO the color palette seems a tad on the cool side? Possibly due to the shade in the background? Maybe adjusting temperature in the RAW stage would have added? Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless.... 7', '2006-01-14 01:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034933, 275902, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great candid. I love the feel and emotive quality of this shot. The color saturation is also excellent. IMHO the focus seems a tad off. Mostly evident in the face and areas of the background material. Looks like the lighting conditions were quite bright. Perhaps you could have gotten away with shutter speeds a few stops higher to improve focus? Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless.... 7</td>', 'Great candid. I love the feel and emotive quality of this shot. The color saturation is also excellent. IMHO the focus seems a tad off. Mostly evident in the face and areas of the background material. Looks like the lighting conditions were quite bright. Perhaps you could have gotten away with shutter speeds a few stops higher to improve focus? Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless.... 7', '2006-01-14 01:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034938, 276817, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice use of selective desaturation to answer the challenge. The tonality of the shot and black areas really give the subject nice contrast. One thing I found distracting was the reflection of the photographer in the sphere. Not sure if this was intentional? If not, perhaps layer masks in p-shop may have helped.</td>', 'Nice use of selective desaturation to answer the challenge. The tonality of the shot and black areas really give the subject nice contrast. One thing I found distracting was the reflection of the photographer in the sphere. Not sure if this was intentional? If not, perhaps layer masks in p-shop may have helped.', '2006-01-14 01:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034940, 277937, 20235, '<td valign="top">I really like your creative composition and dof here. The color saturation looks nice.</td>', 'I really like your creative composition and dof here. The color saturation looks nice.', '2006-01-14 01:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034944, 278060, 45343, '<td valign="top">Cute dog (like you didn''t know) Very nice color.   I particularly like the the catchlights in the eye and the texture in the nose... these things give it a real, living quality.</td>', 'Cute dog (like you didn''t know) Very nice color.   I particularly like the the catchlights in the eye and the texture in the nose... these things give it a real, living quality.', '2006-01-14 01:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034947, 278566, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. It has an emotive/artistic quality that I really like. IMHO a slightly tighter shot or more crop to weight the roofline and birds heavier in the composition would have helped. Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless</td>', 'Very nice shot. It has an emotive/artistic quality that I really like. IMHO a slightly tighter shot or more crop to weight the roofline and birds heavier in the composition would have helped. Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless', '2006-01-14 01:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034950, 278397, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I love the angle you''ve chosen to shoot this at, and the composition used. IMHO this shot would have had a much greater visual impact with a shallow DOF. It would have cleaned up the scene more and really emphasized the subject and color. Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless</td>', 'Nice shot. I love the angle you''ve chosen to shoot this at, and the composition used. IMHO this shot would have had a much greater visual impact with a shallow DOF. It would have cleaned up the scene more and really emphasized the subject and color. Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless', '2006-01-14 01:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034951, 278532, 45343, '<td valign="top">Very interesting location... I look forward to seeing where this is.  I love the color and variety in the balls.  I wonder if moving them down from middle frame to lower 1/3 would give them more energy and help them hold the eyes more.   Currently you have competing background/forground with no clear winner so the eye jumps back and fort over the balls.</td>', 'Very interesting location... I look forward to seeing where this is.  I love the color and variety in the balls.  I wonder if moving them down from middle frame to lower 1/3 would give them more energy and help them hold the eyes more.   Currently you have competing background/forground with no clear winner so the eye jumps back and fort over the balls.', '2006-01-14 01:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034952, 278341, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and great DOF here. Exposure looks spot-on despite the bright sun conditions.</td>', 'Nice composition and great DOF here. Exposure looks spot-on despite the bright sun conditions.', '2006-01-14 01:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034957, 277489, 45343, '<td valign="top">nice blur motion effect.  from the symetry, it seems like the camera moved, rather then "light painting."  My only concern is the lack of a dominate one to be a subject to catch and hold the attention.  As a result, my eye just seems to wander.;</td>', 'nice blur motion effect.  from the symetry, it seems like the camera moved, rather then "light painting."  My only concern is the lack of a dominate one to be a subject to catch and hold the attention.  As a result, my eye just seems to wander.;', '2006-01-14 01:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2034959, 277921, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. The color saturation in the blues and reds is great. IMHO the fence and stairs area is a bit distracting. Perhaps shooting this to include only the blue wall as a background may have helped? Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless</td>', 'Very cool shot. The color saturation in the blues and reds is great. IMHO the fence and stairs area is a bit distracting. Perhaps shooting this to include only the blue wall as a background may have helped? Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless', '2006-01-14 01:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
