(2034964, 278448, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The shallow DOF creates alot of dimension in this shot with the confetti, and the white backdrop really makes the colors ''pop''.  I would have liked to see the composition include more area vertically since the confetti is an intersting element in itself. Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless.... 8</td>', 'Very nice. The shallow DOF creates alot of dimension in this shot with the confetti, and the white backdrop really makes the colors ''pop''.  I would have liked to see the composition include more area vertically since the confetti is an intersting element in itself. Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless.... 8', '2006-01-14 01:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
