(2035209, 276801, 36377, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if it would have been possible but greater DOF would have helped a touch. The out of focus section of eyelash is a little distracting but not too much. Also a tighter crop would help the composition. On the good side I love the detail in the eye and the soft blur and high key of the surronding skin. Holding enough color in the skin to seperate it from the white part of the eye(name escapes me) and the surronding white seems difficult but you pulled it off nicely. I can''t get over that iris. Voted nine but with a tighter crop this would easily be a 10 for me.</td>', 'Don''t know if it would have been possible but greater DOF would have helped a touch. The out of focus section of eyelash is a little distracting but not too much. Also a tighter crop would help the composition. On the good side I love the detail in the eye and the soft blur and high key of the surronding skin. Holding enough color in the skin to seperate it from the white part of the eye(name escapes me) and the surronding white seems difficult but you pulled it off nicely. I can''t get over that iris. Voted nine but with a tighter crop this would easily be a 10 for me.', '2006-01-14 03:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2035211, 278584, 36377, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting on the bluebird. Framed nicely minus the slightly cut of tail. The tag on his leg ruins it for me a little. Knowing it''s not a wild bird. Not too much though. The background is really distracting for me. Would like to see it more out of focus but it already seems that. Maybe a more solid color. I hope that describes it.</td>', 'Nice lighting on the bluebird. Framed nicely minus the slightly cut of tail. The tag on his leg ruins it for me a little. Knowing it''s not a wild bird. Not too much though. The background is really distracting for me. Would like to see it more out of focus but it already seems that. Maybe a more solid color. I hope that describes it.', '2006-01-14 03:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
