(2035524, 278048, 30896, '<td valign="top"><i>&gt;Enter your comment here, and then cast javascript: do_vote(5)<br/>&gt;5 your vote...</i> <br/> <br/>Um, a strange feature of the voting screen, happens to me once in every thousand votes, but usually I notice and delete it. I didn''t even voted 5 (but six). The picture seems oversharpened, I don''t get the title and doesn''t exactly correspond with the challenge description, but on the other hand, the general feeling is good as well as golden light... Still it seems below your standard, good luck next time.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-01-16 12:27:47.</i></td>', '>Enter your comment here, and then cast javascript: do_vote(5)>5 your vote...  Um, a strange feature of the voting screen, happens to me once in every thousand votes, but usually I notice and delete it. I didn''t even voted 5 (but six). The picture seems oversharpened, I don''t get the title and doesn''t exactly correspond with the challenge description, but on the other hand, the general feeling is good as well as golden light... Still it seems below your standard, good luck next time.', '2006-01-14 10:22:11.000000', '2006-01-16 12:27:47.000000', 1),
