(2037318, 277038, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very cool capture. I''m guessing this is some sort of ''paint with light'' effect? The color saturation is really nice and I like the composition used. I can see areas of the black background that are somewhat redish in tone on my monitor. Not sure if it''s remnants from post processing or the actual wall behind the subject. Perhaps adjusting exposure compensation in the RAW stage or tweaking levels/curves in p-shop may help with this? Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless.... 8</td>', 'Very cool capture. I''m guessing this is some sort of ''paint with light'' effect? The color saturation is really nice and I like the composition used. I can see areas of the black background that are somewhat redish in tone on my monitor. Not sure if it''s remnants from post processing or the actual wall behind the subject. Perhaps adjusting exposure compensation in the RAW stage or tweaking levels/curves in p-shop may help with this? Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless.... 8', '2006-01-15 00:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
