(2037404, 278575, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice subject you''ve chosen. IMHO the shot may have had more of an impact if shot tighter. I think everything left of the colored mosaic could have been excluded completely to emphasize the main sibject more. Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless</td>', 'Nice subject you''ve chosen. IMHO the shot may have had more of an impact if shot tighter. I think everything left of the colored mosaic could have been excluded completely to emphasize the main sibject more. Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless', '2006-01-15 01:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037407, 277957, 42984, '<td valign="top">Interestign abstract, it makes a lovely piece of art</td>', 'Interestign abstract, it makes a lovely piece of art', '2006-01-15 01:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037410, 277489, 20235, '<td valign="top">Creative take on the challenge. IMHO the shot seems to lack contrast between the lights and background. On my monitor, the background seems soft and reddish in appearance. Perhaps adjusting levels in P-shop may have helped with this? Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless</td>', 'Creative take on the challenge. IMHO the shot seems to lack contrast between the lights and background. On my monitor, the background seems soft and reddish in appearance. Perhaps adjusting levels in P-shop may have helped with this? Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless', '2006-01-15 01:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037412, 278147, 42013, '<td valign="top">A very nice picture.  I love the lightness that the web adds to the shot.  Takes it from "another nice narrow DOF flower picture" to one with added punch. 8</td>', 'A very nice picture.  I love the lightness that the web adds to the shot.  Takes it from "another nice narrow DOF flower picture" to one with added punch. 8', '2006-01-15 01:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037414, 277918, 42013, '<td valign="top">I like the picture.  It seems as if the whites are just a bit overexposed and its too bad the sky didn''t have some color.  But overall good. 7</td>', 'I like the picture.  It seems as if the whites are just a bit overexposed and its too bad the sky didn''t have some color.  But overall good. 7', '2006-01-15 01:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037415, 278251, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. IMHO the WB seems a tad on the warm side with the background appearing yellowish.</td>', 'Nice composition. IMHO the WB seems a tad on the warm side with the background appearing yellowish.', '2006-01-15 01:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037416, 275651, 42013, '<td valign="top">nice minimalist approach.</td>', 'nice minimalist approach.', '2006-01-15 01:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037418, 277771, 42984, '<td valign="top">That''s a great image.  Neutral space and simplicity really work.  Nice job maintaining the texture of the snow.  Most attractive omposition to the eye is for the point of interest to be off centre on a thirds line and I think this is a caase where the thirds intersection would likely have been worth and extra halfpoint</td>', 'That''s a great image.  Neutral space and simplicity really work.  Nice job maintaining the texture of the snow.  Most attractive omposition to the eye is for the point of interest to be off centre on a thirds line and I think this is a caase where the thirds intersection would likely have been worth and extra halfpoint', '2006-01-15 01:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037419, 278074, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I love the deep DOF and angle that you chose to shoot this at.... 7</td>', 'Great shot. I love the deep DOF and angle that you chose to shoot this at.... 7', '2006-01-15 01:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037420, 278128, 42013, '<td valign="top">This shot is made by the falloff of the pattern in the foreleft. Good job</td>', 'This shot is made by the falloff of the pattern in the foreleft. Good job', '2006-01-15 01:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037421, 278074, 42013, '<td valign="top">A camel or just four legs with some blankets????? :)</td>', 'A camel or just four legs with some blankets????? :)', '2006-01-15 01:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037422, 278306, 42984, '<td valign="top">Nice colour, slightly difficult to dentify a "point" to it.</td>', 'Nice colour, slightly difficult to dentify a "point" to it.', '2006-01-15 01:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037424, 277880, 20235, '<td valign="top">One of my favs in this challenge. Love the setup and composition here. The only thing I find distracting is the reflection in the vase. It looks like a ceiling lamp and/or door in it? Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless... 9</td>', 'One of my favs in this challenge. Love the setup and composition here. The only thing I find distracting is the reflection in the vase. It looks like a ceiling lamp and/or door in it? Just my opinion, nice shot nonetheless... 9', '2006-01-15 01:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037425, 278463, 42013, '<td valign="top">Next time you might try to angle the flower boquet into the shot.  Gives some dynamic interest.  And I think it would help the picture to have cropped out or recomposed to remove the lines.</td>', 'Next time you might try to angle the flower boquet into the shot.  Gives some dynamic interest.  And I think it would help the picture to have cropped out or recomposed to remove the lines.', '2006-01-15 01:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
