(2037438, 277331, 42984, '<td valign="top">Was this for real?  How amazing. A good unusual pic that gets a reaction - can''t ask for more than that. It bugs me you didn''t rotate it to square it up. It makes it look like a careless snapshot.</td>', 'Was this for real?  How amazing. A good unusual pic that gets a reaction - can''t ask for more than that. It bugs me you didn''t rotate it to square it up. It makes it look like a careless snapshot.', '2006-01-15 01:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
