(2037661, 278325, 15002, '<td valign="top">I like it.  The pilot is lost a bit in the mountain.  If shot from a lower angle, so that the pilot was surrounded by sky, he/she would stand out more, and you would get a better sense height.</td>', 'I like it.  The pilot is lost a bit in the mountain.  If shot from a lower angle, so that the pilot was surrounded by sky, he/she would stand out more, and you would get a better sense height.', '2006-01-15 06:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2037666, 277188, 15002, '<td valign="top">I really like the expression on her face.  The hat goes well with those big blue eyes.  IMO  the cropis a bit tight under her chin, but overall well done.</td>', 'I really like the expression on her face.  The hat goes well with those big blue eyes.  IMO  the cropis a bit tight under her chin, but overall well done.', '2006-01-15 06:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
