(2039021, 278227, 8860, '<td valign="top">Sweet! Nicely composed.</td>', 'Sweet! Nicely composed.', '2006-01-15 19:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039022, 278348, 17507, '<td valign="top">interesting photo and technically well accomplished; the exposure, colors, and focus are excellent. I find the grey border a poor choice, though - it distracts from and clashes with the photo.</td>', 'interesting photo and technically well accomplished; the exposure, colors, and focus are excellent. I find the grey border a poor choice, though - it distracts from and clashes with the photo.', '2006-01-15 19:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039039, 278559, 45343, '<td valign="top">Cute... most orriginal.  It is also well executed to boot.  The only constructive thing I can think to add would be a wider DoF.  This is personal taste, but since there isn''t much background to distract, I think it would add a crispness without distracting.  Well done.</td>', 'Cute... most orriginal.  It is also well executed to boot.  The only constructive thing I can think to add would be a wider DoF.  This is personal taste, but since there isn''t much background to distract, I think it would add a crispness without distracting.  Well done.', '2006-01-15 19:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039046, 278092, 17507, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the composition, and the girl is a charmer. I''m not sure how you achieved this, but to me the girl looks like a cardboard cutout. The ragged outline and angularity of her shirt, hair, and left hand make this look like it was shot on a completely different background and then cut out with the Lasso tool. There are things that I like about this picture, but the processing appears clumsy.</td>', 'I like the colors and the composition, and the girl is a charmer. I''m not sure how you achieved this, but to me the girl looks like a cardboard cutout. The ragged outline and angularity of her shirt, hair, and left hand make this look like it was shot on a completely different background and then cut out with the Lasso tool. There are things that I like about this picture, but the processing appears clumsy.', '2006-01-15 19:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039049, 278320, 45343, '<td valign="top">It is certainly a "burst."  I think the closer crop to fill the frame makes me like it more then most "firework" shots.  Rule of thrids placment also enhances the image.  Well done.</td>', 'It is certainly a "burst."  I think the closer crop to fill the frame makes me like it more then most "firework" shots.  Rule of thrids placment also enhances the image.  Well done.', '2006-01-15 19:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
