(2039515, 278531, 48717, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this one, great pic for the challenge.  Bumping it up.  The focus, color, exposure and composition are all very nice.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this one, great pic for the challenge.  Bumping it up.  The focus, color, exposure and composition are all very nice.', '2006-01-15 22:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039519, 278371, 48717, '<td valign="top">Yeah, maybe backlighting, but never the less a beautiful picture.  The lighting is wonderful as is the focus.</td>', 'Yeah, maybe backlighting, but never the less a beautiful picture.  The lighting is wonderful as is the focus.', '2006-01-15 22:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039520, 278475, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract but I find it hard to tell where the focus is. 5</td>', 'Nice abstract but I find it hard to tell where the focus is. 5', '2006-01-15 22:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039523, 277038, 12160, '<td valign="top">Very creative. One of my top picks. 10</td>', 'Very creative. One of my top picks. 10', '2006-01-15 22:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039533, 278201, 17507, '<td valign="top">excellent choice for this challenge. the initial impact is very strong. after looking at it a bit more I find myself wishing that the reds weren''t so heavily saturated; in some areas, they''re almost flat color fields. Other than that, I really like this picture... it has a lot of depth and texture to it. the grasslands in the foreground hold a lot of interest, and the partial desaturation is very effective.</td>', 'excellent choice for this challenge. the initial impact is very strong. after looking at it a bit more I find myself wishing that the reds weren''t so heavily saturated; in some areas, they''re almost flat color fields. Other than that, I really like this picture... it has a lot of depth and texture to it. the grasslands in the foreground hold a lot of interest, and the partial desaturation is very effective.', '2006-01-15 22:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039539, 278377, 17507, '<td valign="top">god DAMN this makes me hungry, mmmmmmmmmm<br/>are you sure you didn''t mean to submit this to Recipes II? :P</td>', 'god DAMN this makes me hungry, mmmmmmmmmmare you sure you didn''t mean to submit this to Recipes II? :P', '2006-01-15 22:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
