(2039552, 278371, 12160, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting. They seem to float nicely in the air. Very effective use of shallow dof. 8</td>', 'Love the lighting. They seem to float nicely in the air. Very effective use of shallow dof. 8', '2006-01-15 22:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039568, 278363, 17507, '<td valign="top">I do not like this picture, but I still think it is good. 7</td>', 'I do not like this picture, but I still think it is good. 7', '2006-01-15 22:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039571, 277349, 12160, '<td valign="top">Zoom burst? A shot like this usually makes me dizzy. Not this one, it is well-controlled. 8</td>', 'Zoom burst? A shot like this usually makes me dizzy. Not this one, it is well-controlled. 8', '2006-01-15 22:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039581, 278541, 17507, '<td valign="top">great deep rich tones. love the radial effect of the sky, there''s kind of a sonority (so to speak) with the jeep &amp; its tires there. but the subject of the photograph is not colorful...</td>', 'great deep rich tones. love the radial effect of the sky, there''s kind of a sonority (so to speak) with the jeep & its tires there. but the subject of the photograph is not colorful...', '2006-01-15 22:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039607, 277955, 12160, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of foreground but I like how the eyes are led to the tiny house in the distance even before I read the title. Well done. 7</td>', 'There is a lot of foreground but I like how the eyes are led to the tiny house in the distance even before I read the title. Well done. 7', '2006-01-15 22:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039618, 277004, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice study in light, shadows and colors. Good execution. 7</td>', 'Nice study in light, shadows and colors. Good execution. 7', '2006-01-15 22:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039623, 278226, 12160, '<td valign="top">Interesting background. Makes for an extraordinary flower shot. Good work. 8</td>', 'Interesting background. Makes for an extraordinary flower shot. Good work. 8', '2006-01-15 22:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039670, 278424, 12160, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning. A top pick for me. 10</td>', 'Simply stunning. A top pick for me. 10', '2006-01-15 23:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039715, 277070, 12160, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. The yellow is highlighted against a dark but not totally dark background. 9</td>', 'I like this a lot. The yellow is highlighted against a dark but not totally dark background. 9', '2006-01-15 23:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039720, 278199, 45343, '<td valign="top">Amazing color and focus.  Well done.  A great DoF and composition.   I love this photo.</td>', 'Amazing color and focus.  Well done.  A great DoF and composition.   I love this photo.', '2006-01-15 23:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039733, 277610, 45343, '<td valign="top">Amazing image...   I would be interested in knowing how you got the exposure so pefect in an image with such widely varying levels.</td>', 'Amazing image...   I would be interested in knowing how you got the exposure so pefect in an image with such widely varying levels.', '2006-01-15 23:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039739, 277772, 45343, '<td valign="top">Again... I am loving simplicity.   Your colors are vivid and well contrasted... I also appreciated the thourough coating you gave inside the pots.  I would be intereted in hearing what your background/dropcloth are made of.  Congrats on a wonderful image.</td>', 'Again... I am loving simplicity.   Your colors are vivid and well contrasted... I also appreciated the thourough coating you gave inside the pots.  I would be intereted in hearing what your background/dropcloth are made of.  Congrats on a wonderful image.', '2006-01-15 23:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039743, 278422, 45343, '<td valign="top">Delightful.  I like the simplicity in the picture.  The colors are fun and the expression is priceless.  I like your off center placement and non-distracting background.</td>', 'Delightful.  I like the simplicity in the picture.  The colors are fun and the expression is priceless.  I like your off center placement and non-distracting background.', '2006-01-15 23:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039758, 278376, 19978, '<td valign="top">Whatever method you used, this image has a three-dimensional quality that is very attractive. I can''t decide if this is a real natural background or if you used a prop. Whatever the case, there is a sharpness and apparent relief that makes me feel as though I can reach out and grab a flower. Well done.</td>', 'Whatever method you used, this image has a three-dimensional quality that is very attractive. I can''t decide if this is a real natural background or if you used a prop. Whatever the case, there is a sharpness and apparent relief that makes me feel as though I can reach out and grab a flower. Well done.', '2006-01-15 23:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039762, 278198, 28695, '<td valign="top">It''s a good idea, but the picture looks a little flat due to the composition and the flash.</td>', 'It''s a good idea, but the picture looks a little flat due to the composition and the flash.', '2006-01-15 23:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039768, 278584, 45343, '<td valign="top">Wow... amazing focus and color.  I also like the DoF to bring out the bird and the catchlight to make the eye stand out.</td>', 'Wow... amazing focus and color.  I also like the DoF to bring out the bird and the catchlight to make the eye stand out.', '2006-01-15 23:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039774, 277636, 19978, '<td valign="top">This looks like you applied a selective blur to the non-flower portions of the arrangement. The effect is very nice, but the irregularity of the boundaries is a bit disconcerting.</td>', 'This looks like you applied a selective blur to the non-flower portions of the arrangement. The effect is very nice, but the irregularity of the boundaries is a bit disconcerting.', '2006-01-15 23:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039775, 278266, 19978, '<td valign="top">This looks like you applied a selective blur to the non-flower portions of the arrangement. The effect is very nice, but the irregularity of the boundaries is a bit disconcerting.</td>', 'This looks like you applied a selective blur to the non-flower portions of the arrangement. The effect is very nice, but the irregularity of the boundaries is a bit disconcerting.', '2006-01-15 23:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039779, 278583, 45343, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the simplicity of this image...  Red is quite vivid.  I also like the texture visible on the white... what is that... paper?  the composition is perfect.  Well done.</td>', 'I enjoy the simplicity of this image...  Red is quite vivid.  I also like the texture visible on the white... what is that... paper?  the composition is perfect.  Well done.', '2006-01-15 23:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039781, 278201, 45343, '<td valign="top">Great image... meets the challenge well... I take it that is a natural phenomenon.  You have captured it well... Well composed.  The sky does not seem as blue as I would have expected for that time of day.  Do you use a circular polarizer?</td>', 'Great image... meets the challenge well... I take it that is a natural phenomenon.  You have captured it well... Well composed.  The sky does not seem as blue as I would have expected for that time of day.  Do you use a circular polarizer?', '2006-01-15 23:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039786, 278363, 45343, '<td valign="top">Very cute image.   I think it is very well thought out and photographed.   It does feel a little cramped, however, and I wonder if it would benifit from a little more white negitive space.</td>', 'Very cute image.   I think it is very well thought out and photographed.   It does feel a little cramped, however, and I wonder if it would benifit from a little more white negitive space.', '2006-01-15 23:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039787, 278424, 19978, '<td valign="top">This is an enormously attractive image, lots of pop. I can''t imagine how you pulled it off. Technique aside, it strikes me as particularly appealing. I think it''ll show up in the top 10.</td>', 'This is an enormously attractive image, lots of pop. I can''t imagine how you pulled it off. Technique aside, it strikes me as particularly appealing. I think it''ll show up in the top 10.', '2006-01-15 23:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2039788, 278363, 19978, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and well executed, but I think the contrast could have been greater. The yellows could pop a little more too.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-01-16 12:47:30.</i></td>', 'Nice idea and well executed, but I think the contrast could have been greater. The yellows could pop a little more too.', '2006-01-15 23:37:07.000000', '2006-01-16 12:47:30.000000', 1),
(2039791, 278237, 19978, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful. Artistic and eye-appeal out the wazoo. Kudos to  you for creating such a wonderful image. Meets the challenge head-on in a unique way. A top 10 for sure.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful. Artistic and eye-appeal out the wazoo. Kudos to  you for creating such a wonderful image. Meets the challenge head-on in a unique way. A top 10 for sure.', '2006-01-15 23:39:26.000000', NULL, 1);
