(2040567, 278080, 37430, '<td valign="top">Great Capture.<br/> <br/>The flower is of "Adenium". Commonly known as "Desert Rose". I''m now desperately waiting for my adenium to flower (Thanks to your picture!). To know more about the species go to //www.tropicanursery.com/adenium/story.htm. Anyway, dont let the water stay on the flower... its a killer for ''desert rose''.</td>', 'Great Capture. The flower is of "Adenium". Commonly known as "Desert Rose". I''m now desperately waiting for my adenium to flower (Thanks to your picture!). To know more about the species go to //www.tropicanursery.com/adenium/story.htm. Anyway, dont let the water stay on the flower... its a killer for ''desert rose''.', '2006-01-16 01:54:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2040576, 277979, 44741, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all that wrote a comment. I purposely used a small photo to hide all the distractions floating in the water. Of course, I didn''t realize some people were using huge monitors. The hippo must have looked very small... My bad.<br/> <br/>In retrospect, I should have known a cute photo would not do well. But hey, at least I didn''t get last place!!<br/> <br/>Regards,<br/> <br/>Andre</td>', 'Thanks to all that wrote a comment. I purposely used a small photo to hide all the distractions floating in the water. Of course, I didn''t realize some people were using huge monitors. The hippo must have looked very small... My bad. In retrospect, I should have known a cute photo would not do well. But hey, at least I didn''t get last place!! Regards, Andre', '2006-01-16 01:55:54.000000', NULL, 0),
