(2042126, 276710, 37893, '<td valign="top">The image also suffers from "lack of wow factor" that most DPCers are looking for in an image. The main "subject" also doesn''t fall under the rules of thirds which is important in images. Eye shots are difficult and it takes trial and error to perfect. I''ve tried a few eye shots and had some success with them. Maybe it''s something that you can try to reshoot again and see what other folks think about it.<br/> <br/>The important thing is to keep on trying and experimenting.</td>', 'The image also suffers from "lack of wow factor" that most DPCers are looking for in an image. The main "subject" also doesn''t fall under the rules of thirds which is important in images. Eye shots are difficult and it takes trial and error to perfect. I''ve tried a few eye shots and had some success with them. Maybe it''s something that you can try to reshoot again and see what other folks think about it. The important thing is to keep on trying and experimenting.', '2006-01-16 10:50:35.000000', NULL, 0),
