(2042954, 275229, 40386, '<td valign="top">I liked this shot but what made me mark it down was the fact that the sharpness was on the white flower to the right rather than the red one.  If it had been on the red flower I definitely would have marked this higher.  Hope this helps.<br/> <br/>Edit for spelling!Sorry<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-01-16 13:24:28.</i></td>', 'I liked this shot but what made me mark it down was the fact that the sharpness was on the white flower to the right rather than the red one.  If it had been on the red flower I definitely would have marked this higher.  Hope this helps. Edit for spelling!Sorry', '2006-01-16 13:23:56.000000', '2006-01-16 13:24:28.000000', 0),
(2043003, 275229, 19672, '<td valign="top">Why I gave you a 5, by Doctor Fritz B. Banzai (a.k.a. The Saj)<br/> <br/>The composition was nice, and you have a natural "color de-selection" photo which is also nice. <br/> <br/>However, flowers are a tough one to score with. There are just so many flower entries.<br/> <br/>Second, the focus is a bit lacking on the center flower.</td>', 'Why I gave you a 5, by Doctor Fritz B. Banzai (a.k.a. The Saj) The composition was nice, and you have a natural "color de-selection" photo which is also nice.  However, flowers are a tough one to score with. There are just so many flower entries. Second, the focus is a bit lacking on the center flower.', '2006-01-16 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
