(2048691, 275902, 45343, '<td valign="top">Hey Brett,   I didnt realize this was yours.  I see you pegged out the apertrue to shorten your shutter as much as possible.  Only other option was to bump your ISO up.  I love your description of getting this image.  No matter what you did with the rest of the images... you couldnt have chosen a better expression.   I think this should have placed higher.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Hey Brett,   I didnt realize this was yours.  I see you pegged out the apertrue to shorten your shutter as much as possible.  Only other option was to bump your ISO up.  I love your description of getting this image.  No matter what you did with the rest of the images... you couldnt have chosen a better expression.   I think this should have placed higher.  Keep up the good work.', '2006-01-17 14:15:31.000000', NULL, 0),
