(2051654, 278541, 51552, '<td valign="top">YES I DO THINK IT WOULD BE A BETTER PHOTO WITHOUT THE JEEP IN IT. WITH THE JEEP IN IT, THE IMAGE BECOMES AN ADVERTISEMENT, AND HAS THE AURA OF THE ADS YOU SEE FOR JEEPS IN MAGAZINES. YOU THINK YOUR IMAGE IS BETTER WITH THE JEEP IN IT BECAUSE YOU''VE SEEN PROFESSIONAL SHOTS IN ADVERTISEMENTS AND ON TELEVISION THAT LOOK EXACTLY LIKE THE ONE ABOVE. ALSO, I FEEL THAT A PERSON WHO WOULD CONNECT MORE WITH A JEEP THAN THEY WOULD A PERSON TO BE AN EXTREMELY SHALLOW PERSON. but whatever you''re into. you seem to know what people will vote up, and i guess i''m the only one who has a problem with what this image represents.</td>', 'YES I DO THINK IT WOULD BE A BETTER PHOTO WITHOUT THE JEEP IN IT. WITH THE JEEP IN IT, THE IMAGE BECOMES AN ADVERTISEMENT, AND HAS THE AURA OF THE ADS YOU SEE FOR JEEPS IN MAGAZINES. YOU THINK YOUR IMAGE IS BETTER WITH THE JEEP IN IT BECAUSE YOU''VE SEEN PROFESSIONAL SHOTS IN ADVERTISEMENTS AND ON TELEVISION THAT LOOK EXACTLY LIKE THE ONE ABOVE. ALSO, I FEEL THAT A PERSON WHO WOULD CONNECT MORE WITH A JEEP THAN THEY WOULD A PERSON TO BE AN EXTREMELY SHALLOW PERSON. but whatever you''re into. you seem to know what people will vote up, and i guess i''m the only one who has a problem with what this image represents.', '2006-01-18 00:33:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2051794, 278168, 42826, '<td valign="top">nice job on your top 10 finish!  it''s well deserved....could have placed higher..but still well deserved...by the way...the eyes are an added touch!</td>', 'nice job on your top 10 finish!  it''s well deserved....could have placed higher..but still well deserved...by the way...the eyes are an added touch!', '2006-01-18 00:51:02.000000', NULL, 0),
