(2790813, 278501, 9285, '<td valign="top">Ouch.. I''ll skip the lecture on this one (hee hee).. saw your comments on the wanting to enter a member''s challenge.. I''ve learnt that if I don''t have a really powerful photo, I''ll skip the challenge.. <br/> <br/>Give it a really good crop.. may be a 6"x3" or even a 6"x2" ratio.. <br/>Removing the sky and the water which does not show off the colours.. <br/> <br/>next, post process to being out the colours.. <br/> <br/>You might get away with a higher standing.. :)<br/> <br/>Hope this helps.</td>', 'Ouch.. I''ll skip the lecture on this one (hee hee).. saw your comments on the wanting to enter a member''s challenge.. I''ve learnt that if I don''t have a really powerful photo, I''ll skip the challenge..  Give it a really good crop.. may be a 6"x3" or even a 6"x2" ratio.. Removing the sky and the water which does not show off the colours..  next, post process to being out the colours..  You might get away with a higher standing.. :) Hope this helps.', '2006-09-03 02:08:23.000000', NULL, 0),
